ORKFLOW (B)\n\nStage 4 is the first implementation stage. Per the job WORKFLOW.md\n(\"Do not try to scaffold around it; the bundle layout depends on\nimmutable Run rows\") and repo CLAUDE.md R4 (\"no half-finished\nimplementations [...] mark it [!] in the active session doc and\nhalt\"), this stage cannot land code until the runs table from\nJOB-WORKFLOW (B) is merged. Re-verified this stage: no runs\nmigration, no template_snapshot / handover_snapshot / handover_md\ncolumns, no events.run_id. State unchanged since stage 1.\n\nSession doc updated with the halt note plus a concrete plan for the\nagent that picks this up once (B) lands: file split, denylist\nwiring, OQ-3 jail check, and the refuse-to-export preconditions\nfrom BUNDLE-DESIGN.md \\xc2\\xa77.\n\nNo source diff. cargo not run.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* stage 3: implement codeless-runtime job_export walker plus serializer that emits manifest, JSONL streams, and the gzipped tar to a server-side path\n\n* stage 5: implement importer with tar-streaming, path-traversal guards, batched SQLite inserts in one transaction, and ImportConflictPolicy (Refuse default) [!] blocked on JOB-WORKFLOW (B) + missing stage-4 chain\n\nRe-verified the (B) precondition (no `runs` migration, no\n`events.run_id`, no `jobs.handover_md`) and the stage-4 source\nchain (`crates/codeless-runtime/src/job_export/` does not exist;\nthe prior `stage 3:` commit `92e844c` is doc-only per\n`git show --stat`). Per repo CLAUDE.md R4 and WORKFLOW.md\n\"Precondition check\", halt with [!]; no `importer.rs` /\n`tar_safety.rs` / `inspect.rs` created.\n\nSession doc gains a full \"Stage 5 — importer [!] halted on (B) +\nstage-4 chain\" section with the three concrete blockers and a\nfile-by-file plan for the agent that picks this up post-(B).\nHandover rewritten to brief stage 6 (or a re-fire of stage 5).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* stage 4: implement importer with tar-streaming, path-traversal guards, batched SQLite inserts in one transaction, and ImportConflictPolicy (Refuse default)\n\n* stage 6: wire export_job, import_job, inspect_job_bundle RPCs in codeless-rpc and codeless-runtime; refuse export of any Job with a non-terminal Run [!] blocked on JOB-WORKFLOW (B) + missing stage-4/5 chain\n\nStage 6 is the RPC seam. Re-verified the (B) blocker: no `runs`\ntable, no `events.run_id`, no `jobs.handover_md`, no\n`crates/codeless-runtime/src/job_export/` directory, no wire\ntypes in `codeless-rpc/src/methods.rs`. The two intervening\ncommits titled `stage 3:` (92e844c) and `stage 4:` (a579c7e) are\nboth session-doc-only. The \"refuse non-terminal Run\" check this\nstage''s own scope sentence requires cannot be implemented against\na schema with no Run concept. Per CLAUDE.md R4 and WORKFLOW.md\n\"Precondition check\", halt with [!]; no source code added.\n\nSession doc gains a \"Stage 6 — RPC wiring\" section with the\nfile-by-file plan for the agent that picks this up after stages\n4 + 5 + (B) land. Handover rewritten for the next session.\n\n* stage 5: wire export_job, import_job, inspect_job_bundle RPCs in codeless-rpc and codeless-runtime; refuse export of any Job with a non-terminal Run\n\n* stage 7: add round-trip property test (export then import into scratch workspace, assert row body equality and ordering) and tar-safety unit tests [!] blocked on JOB-WORKFLOW (B) + missing stage-4/5/6 chain\n\n* stage 6: add round-trip property test (export then import into scratch workspace, assert row body equality and ordering) and tar-safety unit tests\n\n* stage 9: add Export button on Job page and Import Job dialog on workspace sidebar with manifest preview, conflict policy selector, and warnings banner\n\n* stage 8: add Export button on Job page and Import Job dialog on workspace sidebar with manifest preview, conflict policy selector, and warnings banner\n\n* stage 10: add imported-from chip on imported Jobs plus read-only manifest viewer; verify [run] on an imported Job creates ordinal max+1 against destination HEAD [!] blocked on JOB-WORKFLOW (B) + missing stage-4/5/6/7 chain\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* stage 9: add imported-from chip on imported Jobs plus read-only manifest viewer; verify [run] on an imported Job creates ordinal max+1 against destination HEAD\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9a918d95ccd7e596690646bb478b8ead8cb6ff7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/codeless/git/trees/9a918d95ccd7e596690646bb478b8ead8cb6ff7d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/codeless/git/commits/b4dcec0e2f2619a7d6edba77b23bf9343608c303","verification":{"payload":"tree 9a918d95ccd7e596690646bb478b8ead8cb6ff7d\nparent 9a06a4bbb3bb0d85729ec98fdccecc4473509d4a\nauthor Aidan P <aidan@enviroservices.com.au> 1779184691 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779184691 +0800\n\nCodeless/job export (#41)\n\n* stage 1: survey current Job/Run schema and confirm JOB-WORKFLOW (B) precondition status [!] blocked\n\n* stage 0: survey current Job/Run schema and confirm JOB-WORKFLOW (B) precondition status; list every table column the bundle must serialize\n\n* stage 2: design bundle layout and manifest.json schema_version 1 against DOCS/SCOPE-JOB-EXPORT.md; lock the secrets denylist and per-entry size caps\n\n* stage 1: design bundle layout and manifest.json schema_version 1 against DOCS/SCOPE-JOB-EXPORT.md; lock the secrets denylist and per-entry size caps\n\n* stage 2: bundle shape and RPC argument types before any code lands\n\n* stage 4: implement codeless-runtime job_export walker plus serializer that emits manifest, JSONL streams, and the gzipped tar to a server-side path [!] blocked on JOB-WORKFLOW (B)\n\nStage 4 is the first implementation stage. Per the job WORKFLOW.md\n(\"Do not try to scaffold around it; the bundle layout depends on\nimmutable Run ro