b, import_job, inspect_job_bundle RPCs in codeless-rpc and codeless-runtime; refuse export of any Job with a non-terminal Run [!] blocked on JOB-WORKFLOW (B) + missing stage-4/5 chain\n\nStage 6 is the RPC seam. Re-verified the (B) blocker: no `runs`\ntable, no `events.run_id`, no `jobs.handover_md`, no\n`crates/codeless-runtime/src/job_export/` directory, no wire\ntypes in `codeless-rpc/src/methods.rs`. The two intervening\ncommits titled `stage 3:` (92e844c) and `stage 4:` (a579c7e) are\nboth session-doc-only. The \"refuse non-terminal Run\" check this\nstage''s own scope sentence requires cannot be implemented against\na schema with no Run concept. Per CLAUDE.md R4 and WORKFLOW.md\n\"Precondition check\", halt with [!]; no source code added.\n\nSession doc gains a \"Stage 6 — RPC wiring\" section with the\nfile-by-file plan for the agent that picks this up after stages\n4 + 5 + (B) land. Handover rewritten for the next session.\n\n* stage 5: wire export_job, import_job, inspect_job_bundle RPCs in codeless-rpc and codeless-runtime; refuse export of any Job with a non-terminal Run\n\n* stage 7: add round-trip property test (export then import into scratch workspace, assert row body equality and ordering) and tar-safety unit tests [!] blocked on JOB-WORKFLOW (B) + missing stage-4/5/6 chain\n\n* stage 6: add round-trip property test (export then import into scratch workspace, assert row body equality and ordering) and tar-safety unit tests\n\n* stage 9: add Export button on Job page and Import Job dialog on workspace sidebar with manifest preview, conflict policy selector, and warnings banner\n\n* stage 8: add Export button on Job page and Import Job dialog on workspace sidebar with manifest preview, conflict policy selector, and warnings banner\n\n* stage 10: add imported-from chip on imported Jobs plus read-only manifest viewer; verify [run] on an imported Job creates ordinal max+1 against destination HEAD [!] blocked on JOB-WORKFLOW (B) + missing stage-4/5/6/7 chain\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* stage 9: add imported-from chip on imported Jobs plus read-only manifest viewer; verify [run] on an imported Job creates ordinal max+1 against destination HEAD\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqDDQzCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAlc0QAI99E0v7/2o/+daiQisjy7aC\nhDBwRzbPhQH+F0hjYg8bYVzr4uIc6JxehzNwqne4bpColdgcEsYruNlkQax/iALA\nCfRLw9QYxnIngskiSxBrcRWz3i9xlYWXFYHf3SNzpBw0zlw03MMUPXy5DP38VZSr\nETTOuZdJ5Oh9e9DXd9OrIUvoMr7a0q0H9IhZVHvhQ8L8WWwSCQpn58DqlqE96Z4G\nz1JgACDu5IInYpPMEay26VxAtxrkbj2UYKEDcVe5bUgj2QiNSaFkaRQy4JwH5vt9\nyERXx+Kls8skQfzVDRTvHI7DgUFuExt6Znol5CmD6O7i4D9kTgCnXhiau2CgaXcy\nKZ1IxbmIyuIvI3zR3+y1YSztpzSbnvH9KSBnjRghzeyCwWmvDnWPfTamchjcw6/Z\nEXXP0rkP6LKFRe72KAZWurfBv4Zr3qVQe3GBp9L9TkGHa+W7viUuJKIvCUuHW/nh\nVd8savGncJqDsswvpo2WGpFwqs9zt9AvBngQbmEN1YzPkckTRiPVaaNE8nijv8+Y\n1ZR26s5Ag68rREsc4H/55/XHIpiLk1SpEoC3xWflIVGU2N/P9T1crmIGYvxssOgB\nYanUJivv+ODuGGUWTKcxE32ZmD0ifr27VmQyF2e6FlQnLIv1NjeUGVJMXBTMdXgJ\neGehcRdOE554z2jc1TW6\n=hOAl\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-19T09:58:12Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/