"name":"NubeDev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-18T06:13:01Z","email":"aidan@enviroservices.com.au","name":"NubeDev"},"message":"stage 3: introduce the pure-data layer in codeless-tools/src/plan/spec.rs\n\nPlanSpec, PlanStep, Transition with serde plus a validate() pass that\nrejects duplicate step ids and transitions targeting unknown steps.\nTransition deserialises \"stop\" as Stop and any other string as a\nStepId, with field omission defaulting to Stop so the terminal step of\na chain stays terse. Unit tests cover the release-prep linear chain\nfrom JOB-WORKFLOW.md, the duplicate-id and dangling-target rejections,\nplus the \"stop\"/step serde round trip and the omitted-field default.","tree":{"sha":"a2ebba59463f259bb24043ca83346f6ea45d8055","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/codeless/git/trees/a2ebba59463f259bb24043ca83346f6ea45d8055"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/codeless/git/commits/303f1833978d12a5331acae3e7522152f6e32074","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18637436?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev","id":18637436,"login":"NubeDev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NjM3NDM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev","