":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18637436?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev","id":18637436,"login":"NubeDev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NjM3NDM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/codeless/commits/42f0728451766c72f24736f85a2eda8e9780abee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-18T05:34:43Z","email":"aidan@enviroservices.com.au","name":"NubeDev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-18T05:34:43Z","email":"aidan@enviroservices.com.au","name":"NubeDev"},"message":"M4a: per-tab active-workspace zustand store; subscribe to workspace_attached / workspace_detached events and reconcile the store; render the empty-state screen when list_workspaces returns []\n\nPer-tab zustand store under `src/modules/workspaces/store.ts` mirrors\nthe server-side `attached_workspaces` set as a live, eventually-\nconsistent UI projection. Reducer-style `applyAttached` /\n`applyDetached` actions are idempotent against subscription replay,\nand detaching the active workspace falls back to the most-recently-\nattached survivor per DOCS/WORKSPACE-ATTACH.md §\"Edge cases\".\n\n`useWorkspacesSync` hydrates the store via `list_workspaces` and\nsubscribes to the `all` event scope, dispatching `workspace-attached`\n/ `workspace-detached` payloads into the reducers. The wire''s\n`Event` union does not yet carry that pair (only the unhealthy /\nrecovered pair the liveness sweep emits), so the dispatch matches by\nstring tag — the day the runtime emits the attach/detach events the\nUI reconciles without another shell-side change.\n\n`EmptyWorkspacesState` replaces the current \"fs_root not set\" silent\nfailure mode with the doc''s blank-state screen; the attach modal\nitself lands in M4b.\n\nMockRpcClient gains the four workspace methods so tests + dev shells\nexercise the store against the same surface the real host will\nexpose. Empty-by-default attached set keeps the empty-state path the\ndefault flow.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4ea3d95041eae1f9d80db0b7c74bc42a9e3dc91a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/codeless/git/trees/4ea3d95041eae1f9d80db0b7c74bc42a9e3dc91a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/codeless/git/commits/42f0728451766c72f24736f85a2eda8e9780abee","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18637436?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev","id":18637436,"login":"NubeDev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NjM3NDM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/subscriptions","ty