t/trees/64d2b591c3af79ba786fc584762ab546e8b1745d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/git/commits/95b4b929d4a1b7ef53e5f6d5b75d6b9e418d1bd4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commit/95b4b929d4a1b7ef53e5f6d5b75d6b9e418d1bd4","node_id":"C_kwDOSbDot9oAKDk1YjRiOTI5ZDRhMWI3ZWY1M2U1ZjZkNWI3NWQ2YjllNDE4ZDFiZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commit/4bb6ed36af9b113ed3377d6e45ab6e8f96a75da4","sha":"4bb6ed36af9b113ed3377d6e45ab6e8f96a75da4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/4bb6ed36af9b113ed3377d6e45ab6e8f96a75da4"}],"sha":"95b4b929d4a1b7ef53e5f6d5b75d6b9e418d1bd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/95b4b929d4a1b7ef53e5f6d5b75d6b9e418d1bd4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/4bb6ed36af9b113ed3377d6e45ab6e8f96a75da4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T09:36:56Z","email":"ouokkimohamed7@gmail.com","name":"Mohamed Ouokki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T09:36:56Z","email":"ouokkimohamed7@gmail.com","name":"Mohamed Ouokki"},"message":"ci: add Vercel deployment configuration for shell and remote-widgets\n\nAdds vercel.json to both apps:\n  - apps/shell/vercel.json     — SPA rewrite + aggressive asset caching +\n    no-cache for module-federation.manifest.json (so remote URL updates\n    are picked up immediately without a shell redeploy)\n  - apps/remote-widgets/vercel.json — SPA rewrite + CORS headers so the\n    shell can load federated modules cross-origin in production\n\nUpdates the release job in ci.yml to build both apps and upload both\nartifacts. The Vercel deploy steps are included but commented out;\nuncomment and add the four repository secrets (VERCEL_TOKEN,\nVERCEL_ORG_ID, VERCEL_SHELL_PROJECT_ID, VERCEL_REMOTE_WIDGETS_PROJECT_ID)\nto activate live deployment on every main push.\n\nDeployment order matters: remote-widgets must be deployed first so its URL\nis known before updating the shell''s federation manifest. The commented\nsteps reflect this ordering.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"999ae0b6bf725634dfbec80c54a3bb3c3c17934a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/git/trees/999ae0b6bf725634dfbec80c54a3bb3c3c17934a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/git/commits/4bb6ed36af9b113ed3377d6e45ab6e8f96a75da4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commit/4bb6ed36af9b113ed3377d6e45ab6e8f96a75da4","node_id":"C_kwDOSbDot9oAKDRiYjZlZDM2YWY5YjExM2VkMzM3N2Q2ZTQ1YWI2ZThmOTZhNzVkYTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commit/e474c69f167a2545b28b82644ba7486f38fd0dca","sha":"e474c69f167a2545b28b82644ba7486f38fd0dca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/e474c69f167a2545b28b82644ba7486f38fd0dca"}],"sha":"4bb6ed36af9b113ed3377d6e45ab6e8f96a75da4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/4bb6ed36af9b113ed3377d6e45ab6e8f96a75da4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/e474c69f167a2545b28b82644ba7486f38fd0dca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T09:36:06Z","email":"ouokkimohamed7@gmail.com","name":"Mohamed Ouokki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T09:36:06Z","email":"ouokkimohamed7@gmail.com","name":"Mohamed Ouokki"},"message":"test(workspace): add ArchUnit-style layer enforcement rules for feat, ui, and data-access\n\nAdds three no-restricted-imports overrides to the root ESLint config that\ncomplement @nx/enforce-module-boundaries with per-file granularity:\n\n  Rule 1 (feat/**): HttpClient is forbidden in feature libraries.\n    Feature components must call data-access services, not HttpClient\n    directly. Spec files are excluded so TestBed.configureTestingModule\n    can still call provideHttpClient() in integration tests.\n\n  Rule 2 (ui/**): @ngrx/store, @ngrx/effects, @ngrx/entity are forbidden\n    in UI libraries. Presentational components must stay store-agnostic\n    and receive data only via signal inputs.\n\n  Rule 3 (data-access/**): Imports matching ''**/feat-*'' are forbidden in\n    data-access libraries, preventing inverted dependencies.\n\nAll ten projects pass lint with the new rules active. Verified by\nintentional violations during development — each rule fires correctly.\n\nArchitecture constraints are fully documented in docs/architecture-tests.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ab54187b14e664268eee460a9951759e891a73d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/git/trees/ab54187b14e664268eee460a9951759e891a73d8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/git/commits/e474c69f167a2545b28b82644ba7486f38fd0dca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commit/e474c69f167a2545b28b82644ba7486f38fd0dca","node_id":"C_kwDOSbDot9oAKGU0NzRjNjlmMTY3YTI1NDViMjhiODI2NDRiYTc0ODZmMzhmZDBkY2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commit/2cac4a224e25cddf3b58b8737f8d8e7305fc14a1","sha":"2cac4a224e25cddf3b58b8737f8d8e7305fc14a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/2cac4a224e25cddf3b58b8737f8d8e7305fc14a1"}],"sha":"e474c69f167a2545b28b82644ba7486f38fd0dca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/e474c69f167a2545b28b82644ba7486f38fd0dca"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/2cac4a224e25cddf3b58b8737f8d8e7305fc14a1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T09:30:43Z","email":"ouokkimohamed7@gmail.com","name":"Mohamed Ouokki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T09:30:43Z","email":"ouokkimohamed7@gmail.com","name":"Mohamed Ouokki"},"message":"test: add Storybook 8 for all shared UI libraries with Chromatic integration guide\n\nConfigures @storybook/angular 8 via @nx/storybook:configuration for the\nfour shared UI libraries: ui-button, ui-input, ui-table, ui-modal.\n\nStories written:\n  - ButtonComponent: all 4 variants × 3 sizes + loading + disabled + all-variants overview\n  - InputComponent: default, with-error, password, search\n  - TableComponent: 50-row default, 10 000-row virtual-scroll demo, empty state\n  - ModalComponent: default, destructive-action\n\nTo run Storybook for a library:\n  pnpm exec nx run shared-ui-button:storybook\n\nTo build all UI Storybooks:\n  pnpm exec nx run-many -t build-storybook --projects=shared-ui-button,shared-ui-input,shared-ui-table,shared-ui-modal\n\nChromatic wiring is documented in docs/storybook.md as the next step\n(not configured here — requires a project token and Chromatic account).\nThe Chromatic step can be added to ci.yml with two lines once the token\nis available.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"800ba2b5c2701bcdd80369b13d589c50e7c44436","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/git/trees/800ba2b5c2701bcdd80369b13d589c50e7c44436"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/git/commits/2cac4a224e25cddf3b58b8737f8d8e7305fc14a1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commit/2cac4a224e25cddf3b58b8737f8d8e7305fc14a1","node_id":"C_kwDOSbDot9oAKDJjYWM0YTIyNGUyNWNkZGYzYjU4Yjg3MzdmOGQ4ZTczMDVmYzE0YTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commit/ca8b3a827f2ec869f60dadf30e262f0c95073460","sha":"ca8b3a827f2ec869f60dadf30e262f0c95073460","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/ca8b3a827f2ec869f60dadf30e262f0c95073460"}],"sha":"2cac4a224e25cddf3b58b8737f8d8e7305fc14a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/2cac4a224e25cddf3b58b8737f8d8e7305fc14a1"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/ca8b3a827f2ec869f60dadf30e262f0c95073460/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T09:28:21Z","email":"ouokkimohamed7@gmail.com","name":"Mohamed Ouokki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T09:28:21Z","email":"ouokkimohamed7@gmail.com","name":"Mohamed Ouokki"},"message":"test: add Cypress e2e for critical user flow\n\nAdds Cypress 13 e2e configuration to the shell project via\n@nx/cypress:configuration. The test suite covers six scenarios:\n\n1. / redirects to /dashboard\n2. Navigation bar contains all three route links\n3. Dashboard renders metric cards from the MetricsService\n4. Settings page loads and renders the user settings form\n5. Changing the theme select triggers the \"Unsaved changes\" indicator\n   (verifying the NgRx auto-save on valueChanges)\n6. Remote-fallback: intercepting all localhost:4201 requests with\n   forceNetworkError causes /widgets to render RemoteErrorComponent\n\nApp uses demo auth (AuthService starts authenticated), so no login\nstep is required. localStorage is cleared in beforeEach to start each\ntest from clean default settings state.\n\nTests run in CI via nx run shell:e2e against shell:serve-static\n(pre-built artifact — no live server needed in the pipeline).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7015befa3419f70c2005b6f1ded648e0d0e6d7d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/git/trees/7015befa3419f70c2005b6f1ded648e0d0e6d7d6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/git/commits/ca8b3a827f2ec869f60dadf30e262f0c95073460","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commit/ca8b3a827f2ec869f60dadf30e262f0c95073460","node_id":"C_kwDOSbDot9oAKGNhOGIzYTgyN2YyZWM4NjlmNjBkYWRmMzBlMjYyZjBjOTUwNzM0NjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commit/0e2f225f2b189a6cc2c0ac7cfbaa3dd65d3eabb3","sha":"0e2f225f2b189a6cc2c0ac7cfbaa3dd65d3eabb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/0e2f225f2b189a6cc2c0ac7cfbaa3dd65d3eabb3"}],"sha":"ca8b3a827f2ec869f60dadf30e262f0c95073460","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/ca8b3a827f2ec869f60dadf30e262f0c95073460"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/0e2f225f2b189a6cc2c0ac7cfbaa3dd65d3eabb3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T09:23:21Z","email":"ouokkimohamed7@gmail.com","name":"Mohamed Ouokki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T09:23:21Z","email":"ouokkimohamed7@gmail.com","name":"Mohamed Ouokki"},"message":"feat(shell): integrate remote-widgets with fallback error boundary and nav loading indicator\n\nWires the /widgets route to the remote-widgets remote via dynamic Module\nFederation. Adds two resilience features:\n\n1. Error boundary — loadChildren wraps loadRemoteModule in .catch().\n   When the remote is unreachable the shell redirects to RemoteErrorComponent\n   which explains the problem and links back to /dashboard. The shell\n   stays fully usable without the remote.\n\n2. Navigation progress bar — AppComponent now tracks Router NavigationStart\n   / NavigationEnd events via toSignal(). An @if-driven progress bar renders\n   during any lazy load (remote or local), giving instant feedback when\n   loading a large chunk on a slow connection.\n\nBoth are unit-tested (5 shell tests passing).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ed2c7276e3d0ac55b3c6f41eb9093d6aa60febaf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/git/trees/ed2c7276e3d0ac55b3c6f41eb9093d6aa60febaf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/git/commits/0e2f225f2b189a6cc2c0ac7cfbaa3dd65d3eabb3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commit/0e2f225f2b189a6cc2c0ac7cfbaa3dd65d3eabb3","node_id":"C_kwDOSbDot9oAKDBlMmYyMjVmMmIxODlhNmNjMmMwYWM3Y2ZiYWEzZGQ2NWQzZWFiYjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commit/2fb8849b2b35058a999b86789ae413bac78c8f68","sha":"2fb8849b2b35058a999b86789ae413bac78c8f68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/2fb8849b2b35058a999b86789ae413bac78c8f68"}],"sha":"0e2f225f2b189a6cc2c0ac7cfbaa3dd65d3eabb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/0e2f225f2b189a6cc2c0ac7cfbaa3dd65d3eabb3"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/2fb8849b2b35058a999b86789ae413bac78c8f68/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T09:21:32Z","email":"ouokkimohamed7@gmail.com","name":"Mohamed Ouokki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T09:21:32Z","email":"ouokkimohamed7@gmail.com","name":"Mohamed Ouokki"},"message":"feat(remote-widgets): scaffold Module Federation remote for widget catalog\n\nAdds apps/remote-widgets as a Webpack 5 Module Federation remote served\non port 4201. The remote exposes:\n  - ./Routes — Angular router entry routes\n  - ./WidgetCatalog — standalone WidgetCatalogComponent\n\nWidgetCatalogComponent lists all shared UI components with category\nfilter (signals-based), status badges, and download counts.\nAll OnPush with @for/@if control flow, 7 tests passing.\n\nThe shell is converted to @nx/angular:webpack-browser + the\nmodule-federation-dev-server executor. Dynamic federation via\nmodule-federation.manifest.json decouples remote URLs from the shell\nbuild — no shell rebuild needed when a remote is redeployed.\n\nShared dependencies (Angular, RxJS, zone.js) are singletons with\nstrictVersion: false; version-negotiation strategy documented in\ndocs/module-federation.md and ADR 0005.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6b572cbcf7167be985d70183283e00f2c2a9857a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/git/trees/6b572cbcf7167be985d70183283e00f2c2a9857a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/git/commits/2fb8849b2b35058a999b86789ae413bac78c8f68","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commit/2fb8849b2b35058a999b86789ae413bac78c8f68","node_id":"C_kwDOSbDot9oAKDJmYjg4NDliMmIzNTA1OGE5OTliODY3ODlhZTQxM2JhYzc4YzhmNjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commit/1c7084f4b23f9a92762f251643422907e2db026f","sha":"1c7084f4b23f9a92762f251643422907e2db026f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/1c7084f4b23f9a92762f251643422907e2db026f"}],"sha":"2fb8849b2b35058a999b86789ae413bac78c8f68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/2fb8849b2b35058a999b86789ae413bac78c8f68"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/1c7084f4b23f9a92762f251643422907e2db026f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T09:06:30Z","email":"ouokkimohamed7@gmail.com","name":"Mohamed Ouokki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T09:06:30Z","email":"ouokkimohamed7@gmail.com","name":"Mohamed Ouokki"},"message":"fix(shell): update app component spec to match new shell template\n\nRemoves stale NxWelcomeComponent assertion (''Welcome shell'' h1 no longer\nexists). Tests now verify the nav element and title property.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Mohamed ouokki <ouokkimohamed7@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"7c115c6b3789580ab5270b838d7dd2747f25a750","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/git/trees/7c115c6b3789580ab5270b838d7dd2747f25a750"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/git/commits/1c7084f4b23f9a92762f251643422907e2db026f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commit/1c7084f4b23f9a92762f251643422907e2db026f","node_id":"C_kwDOSbDot9oAKDFjNzA4NGY0YjIzZjlhOTI3NjJmMjUxNjQzNDIyOTA3ZTJkYjAyNmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commit/8692b67dafac23b553d43782939b543ad812765d","sha":"8692b67dafac23b553d43782939b543ad812765d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/8692b67dafac23b553d43782939b543ad812765d"}],"sha":"1c7084f4b23f9a92762f251643422907e2db026f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/1c7084f4b23f9a92762f251643422907e2db026f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/8692b67dafac23b553d43782939b543ad812765d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T09:00:42Z","email":"ouokkimohamed7@gmail.com","name":"Mohamed Ouokki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T09:00:42Z","email":"ouokkimohamed7@gmail.com","name":"Mohamed Ouokki"},"message":"docs: complete README, add CONTRIBUTING guide and MIT LICENSE\n\nREADME covers architecture overview, module boundary rules, custom generators,\nADR index, performance configuration, and quick-start commands. CONTRIBUTING\ndocuments branch workflow, commit format, code standards, and library scaffolding.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Mohamed ouokki <ouokkimohamed7@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"6350bbc755df762c6f85dc37af6c90061d896da0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/git/trees/6350bbc755df762c6f85dc37af6c90061d896da0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/git/commits/8692b67dafac23b553d43782939b543ad812765d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commit/8692b67dafac23b553d43782939b543ad812765d","node_id":"C_kwDOSbDot9oAKDg2OTJiNjdkYWZhYzIzYjU1M2Q0Mzc4MjkzOWI1NDNhZDgxMjc2NWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commit/7b06ed41e178e4cb90cc8fdf659cd704c602ffe9","sha":"7b06ed41e178e4cb90cc8fdf659cd704c602ffe9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/7b06ed41e178e4cb90cc8fdf659cd704c602ffe9"}],"sha":"8692b67dafac23b553d43782939b543ad812765d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/8692b67dafac23b553d43782939b543ad812765d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/7b06ed41e178e4cb90cc8fdf659cd704c602ffe9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T08:59:01Z","email":"ouokkimohamed7@gmail.com","name":"Mohamed Ouokki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T08:59:01Z","email":"ouokkimohamed7@gmail.com","name":"Mohamed Ouokki"},"message":"ci: add GitHub Actions workflow with Nx affected lint/test/build\n\nRuns nx affected for lint, test, and build on push to develop/main and on\nPRs to main. Uses nrwl/nx-set-shas to compute correct base/head refs.\nRelease job on main builds the shell app for production and uploads the dist\nartifact. Parallel=3 for tests, parallel=2 for builds.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Mohamed ouokki <ouokkimohamed7@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"4a1f3aca7f53e8bd81e694f259664c79f289d652","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/git/trees/4a1f3aca7f53e8bd81e694f259664c79f289d652"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/git/commits/7b06ed41e178e4cb90cc8fdf659cd704c602ffe9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commit/7b06ed41e178e4cb90cc8fdf659cd704c602ffe9","node_id":"C_kwDOSbDot9oAKDdiMDZlZDQxZTE3OGU0Y2I5MGNjOGZkZjY1OWNkNzA0YzYwMmZmZTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commit/59b3b5405af9899bfa1abeba361742febfc61139","sha":"59b3b5405af9899bfa1abeba361742febfc61139","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/59b3b5405af9899bfa1abeba361742febfc61139"}],"sha":"7b06ed41e178e4cb90cc8fdf659cd704c602ffe9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/7b06ed41e178e4cb90cc8fdf659cd704c602ffe9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/59b3b5405af9899bfa1abeba361742febfc61139/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T08:58:34Z","email":"ouokkimohamed7@gmail.com","name":"Mohamed Ouokki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T08:58:34Z","email":"ouokkimohamed7@gmail.com","name":"Mohamed Ouokki"},"message":"perf: tighten bundle budgets, enable optimizer flags, and document in ADR 0003\n\nReduces initial bundle warning threshold to 350 KB / 600 KB error; adds\nlazy chunk budget (150 KB warn / 300 KB error); enables inlineCritical CSS\nfor faster FCP. ADR 0003 documents rationale and investigation checklist.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Mohamed ouokki <ouokkimohamed7@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"8183d7b17d38b7ea00d73eebf599db2c8d4d4fe4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/git/trees/8183d7b17d38b7ea00d73eebf599db2c8d4d4fe4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/git/commits/59b3b5405af9899bfa1abeba361742febfc61139","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commit/59b3b5405af9899bfa1abeba361742febfc61139","node_id":"C_kwDOSbDot9oAKDU5YjNiNTQwNWFmOTg5OWJmYTFhYmViYTM2MTc0MmZlYmZjNjExMzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commit/f4cc9522b4b3009faf51ed7b2053ddd1584eba99","sha":"f4cc9522b4b3009faf51ed7b2053ddd1584eba99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/f4cc9522b4b3009faf51ed7b2053ddd1584eba99"}],"sha":"59b3b5405af9899bfa1abeba361742febfc61139","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/59b3b5405af9899bfa1abeba361742febfc61139"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/f4cc9522b4b3009faf51ed7b2053ddd1584eba99/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T08:57:50Z","email":"ouokkimohamed7@gmail.com","name":"Mohamed Ouokki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T08:57:50Z","email":"ouokkimohamed7@gmail.com","name":"Mohamed Ouokki"},"message":"feat(shell): add SelectivePreloadStrategy respecting data.preload and navigator.connection\n\nCustom PreloadingStrategy preloads routes only when route.data.preload is true\nand the user is on a fast connection (skips 2g/slow-2g and saveData mode).\nRegistered via withPreloading() in app.config.ts. Dashboard is marked preload:true,\nsettings preload:false.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Mohamed ouokki <ouokkimohamed7@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"b0a07c835b9ca0594f7bea32a17b386653de8727","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/git/trees/b0a07c835b9ca0594f7bea32a17b386653de8727"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/git/commits/f4cc9522b4b3009faf51ed7b2053ddd1584eba99","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commit/f4cc9522b4b3009faf51ed7b2053ddd1584eba99","node_id":"C_kwDOSbDot9oAKGY0Y2M5NTIyYjRiMzAwOWZhZjUxZWQ3YjIwNTNkZGQxNTg0ZWJhOTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commit/b6cdae60b6bfba4dab53e13c2c5401891f5ec914","sha":"b6cdae60b6bfba4dab53e13c2c5401891f5ec914","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/b6cdae60b6bfba4dab53e13c2c5401891f5ec914"}],"sha":"f4cc9522b4b3009faf51ed7b2053ddd1584eba99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/f4cc9522b4b3009faf51ed7b2053ddd1584eba99"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/b6cdae60b6bfba4dab53e13c2c5401891f5ec914/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T08:57:12Z","email":"ouokkimohamed7@gmail.com","name":"Mohamed Ouokki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T08:57:12Z","email":"ouokkimohamed7@gmail.com","name":"Mohamed Ouokki"},"message":"feat(shell): configure lazy-loaded routes with functional authGuard\n\nSets up root routing: dashboard and settings routes lazy-load their feature\ncomponents via loadComponent(). authGuard (functional CanActivateFn) reads\nAuthService signal to redirect unauthenticated users to /login. Adds\nprovideStore/provideEffects for NgRx settings, provideHttpClient, and\nwithViewTransitions/withComponentInputBinding to the app config.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Mohamed ouokki <ouokkimohamed7@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"afef0eb196be3ef75ed6f234698cd56a87371abe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/git/trees/afef0eb196be3ef75ed6f234698cd56a87371abe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/git/commits/b6cdae60b6bfba4dab53e13c2c5401891f5ec914","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commit/b6cdae60b6bfba4dab53e13c2c5401891f5ec914","node_id":"C_kwDOSbDot9oAKGI2Y2RhZTYwYjZiZmJhNGRhYjUzZTEzYzJjNTQwMTg5MWY1ZWM5MTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commit/6b42f7db25ce28b39f9c3b2069dd7164dd9b4a80","sha":"6b42f7db25ce28b39f9c3b2069dd7164dd9b4a80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/6b42f7db25ce28b39f9c3b2069dd7164dd9b4a80"}],"sha":"b6cdae60b6bfba4dab53e13c2c5401891f5ec914","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/b6cdae60b6bfba4dab53e13c2c5401891f5ec914"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/6b42f7db25ce28b39f9c3b2069dd7164dd9b4a80/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T08:55:45Z","email":"ouokkimohamed7@gmail.com","name":"Mohamed Ouokki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T08:55:45Z","email":"ouokkimohamed7@gmail.com","name":"Mohamed Ouokki"},"message":"docs: add ADRs for signals vs NgRx state strategy and OnPush enforcement\n\nADR 0001 documents decision rules: signals for dashboard (transient, computed-heavy)\nvs NgRx for settings (persisted, DevTools, effects). ADR 0002 records OnPush mandate\nwith the ESLint rule that enforces it across all libraries.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Mohamed ouokki <ouokkimohamed7@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"156ccd51e05770a854ef5cff05a171fe5cc310fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/git/trees/156ccd51e05770a854ef5cff05a171fe5cc310fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/git/commits/6b42f7db25ce28b39f9c3b2069dd7164dd9b4a80","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commit/6b42f7db25ce28b39f9c3b2069dd7164dd9b4a80","node_id":"C_kwDOSbDot9oAKDZiNDJmN2RiMjVjZTI4YjM5ZjljM2IyMDY5ZGQ3MTY0ZGQ5YjRhODA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commit/c69ad223ea2ad66de36f8cd07869296d29a7f523","sha":"c69ad223ea2ad66de36f8cd07869296d29a7f523","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/c69ad223ea2ad66de36f8cd07869296d29a7f523"}],"sha":"6b42f7db25ce28b39f9c3b2069dd7164dd9b4a80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/6b42f7db25ce28b39f9c3b2069dd7164dd9b4a80"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/c69ad223ea2ad66de36f8cd07869296d29a7f523/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T08:54:53Z","email":"ouokkimohamed7@gmail.com","name":"Mohamed Ouokki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T08:54:53Z","email":"ouokkimohamed7@gmail.com","name":"Mohamed Ouokki"},"message":"feat(feat-settings): add settings page with reactive forms and NgRx integration\n\nImplements SettingsPageComponent with reactive forms bound to NgRx store.\nForm changes auto-dispatch updateSettings; reset button dispatches resetSettings.\nDisplays dirty/loading/error state from store. 11 Jest/Spectator tests with MockStore.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Mohamed ouokki <ouokkimohamed7@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"2956d3ae421e8c2608057fddac2038aee8f454b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/git/trees/2956d3ae421e8c2608057fddac2038aee8f454b5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/git/commits/c69ad223ea2ad66de36f8cd07869296d29a7f523","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commit/c69ad223ea2ad66de36f8cd07869296d29a7f523","node_id":"C_kwDOSbDot9oAKGM2OWFkMjIzZWEyYWQ2NmRlMzZmOGNkMDc4NjkyOTZkMjlhN2Y1MjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commit/d6a5c2b717f2e1f15687486e6f4f776cc74542c2","sha":"d6a5c2b717f2e1f15687486e6f4f776cc74542c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/d6a5c2b717f2e1f15687486e6f4f776cc74542c2"}],"sha":"c69ad223ea2ad66de36f8cd07869296d29a7f523","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/c69ad223ea2ad66de36f8cd07869296d29a7f523"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/d6a5c2b717f2e1f15687486e6f4f776cc74542c2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T08:52:56Z","email":"ouokkimohamed7@gmail.com","name":"Mohamed Ouokki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T08:52:56Z","email":"ouokkimohamed7@gmail.com","name":"Mohamed Ouokki"},"message":"feat(data-access-settings): add NgRx store for user settings with localStorage persistence\n\nImplements full NgRx pattern: actions (load/update/reset), typesafe reducer,\nmemoized selectors, and effects with localStorage meta-persistence. Installs\n@ngrx/store@18 and @ngrx/effects@18 to match Angular 18. 10 unit tests for\nreducer and selectors.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Mohamed ouokki <ouokkimohamed7@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"80158db6ebe98692306abcdb62dde5141930ad41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/git/trees/80158db6ebe98692306abcdb62dde5141930ad41"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/git/commits/d6a5c2b717f2e1f15687486e6f4f776cc74542c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commit/d6a5c2b717f2e1f15687486e6f4f776cc74542c2","node_id":"C_kwDOSbDot9oAKGQ2YTVjMmI3MTdmMmUxZjE1Njg3NDg2ZTZmNGY3NzZjYzc0NTQyYzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commit/2937fb7da7de5aa46adc0c9714236eafddb3ceec","sha":"2937fb7da7de5aa46adc0c9714236eafddb3ceec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/2937fb7da7de5aa46adc0c9714236eafddb3ceec"}],"sha":"d6a5c2b717f2e1f15687486e6f4f776cc74542c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/d6a5c2b717f2e1f15687486e6f4f776cc74542c2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/2937fb7da7de5aa46adc0c9714236eafddb3ceec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T08:50:48Z","email":"ouokkimohamed7@gmail.com","name":"Mohamed Ouokki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T08:50:48Z","email":"ouokkimohamed7@gmail.com","name":"Mohamed Ouokki"},"message":"feat(feat-dashboard): add dashboard page with metric cards and 10k-row activity table\n\nImplements DashboardPageComponent consuming MetricsService signals. Renders\n4 metric cards (MetricCardComponent) and a virtual-scrolled activity table with\nlive text filtering. MetricCard formats large numbers with K/M suffixes.\n16 Jest/Spectator tests across both components.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Mohamed ouokki <ouokkimohamed7@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"7b676b70cadc7733488ef6923e511afb0f1e39d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/git/trees/7b676b70cadc7733488ef6923e511afb0f1e39d6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/git/commits/2937fb7da7de5aa46adc0c9714236eafddb3ceec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commit/2937fb7da7de5aa46adc0c9714236eafddb3ceec","node_id":"C_kwDOSbDot9oAKDI5MzdmYjdkYTdkZTVhYTQ2YWRjMGM5NzE0MjM2ZWFmZGRiM2NlZWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commit/9f331570c342a8a79c41acd6d56d13115f2cadb9","sha":"9f331570c342a8a79c41acd6d56d13115f2cadb9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/9f331570c342a8a79c41acd6d56d13115f2cadb9"}],"sha":"2937fb7da7de5aa46adc0c9714236eafddb3ceec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/2937fb7da7de5aa46adc0c9714236eafddb3ceec"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ouokki/angular-large-app-architecture/commits/9f331570c342a8a79c41acd6d56d13115f2cadb9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T08:47:29Z","email":"ouokkimohamed7@gmail.com","name":"Mohamed Ouokki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T08:47:29Z","email":"ouokkimohamed7@gmail.com","name":"Mohamed Ouokki"},"message":"feat(data-access-metrics): add signals-based metrics service with 10k activity rows\n\nIntroduces MetricsService using Angular signals for reactive state management.\nExposes computed signals for cards, activity, loading, and error state.\nGenerates 10 000 activity rows for virtual-scroll demo. Includes MetricCard,\nActivityRow and MetricsState models. 9 Jest unit tests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Mohamed ouokki <ouokkimohamed7@gmail.com>","tree"