thub.com/users/dgocta/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dgocta","id":232647723,"login":"dgocta","node_id":"U_kgDODd3sKw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/commits/b1d57e8d45f0dacc54e4993f786f9771d2cda209/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-27T05:48:01Z","email":"dhruv.garg@salescode.ai","name":"dgocta"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-27T05:48:01Z","email":"dhruv.garg@salescode.ai","name":"dgocta"},"message":"expand eval to 37 questions and upgrade eval script\n\nTest set changes:\n- Was 20 questions (Star Health + Group Health only)\n- Now 37 questions: 19 SBI, 8 Star Health, 6 Group Health, 3 cross-doc, 1 meta\n- Added SBI-specific tests: dispute resolution, co-pay, convalescence, domiciliary\n  exclusions, cumulative bonus, cancellation refund, ayurvedic, cataract, etc.\n- Added negative/exclusion tests: cosmetic surgery, maternity, mental illness,\n  fraudulent claim — these exercise the keyword-retrieval guardrail fixes\n- Updated meta question ground truth to include all 3 documents\n\nEval script changes:\n- Add answer_relevancy as 4th RAGAS metric\n- Per-question score table with colour-coded pass/fail (threshold 0.60)\n- Summary section with bar chart + failure count\n- Explicit FAILED QUESTIONS block listing which metrics each question fails on\n- Shows whether retrieved_chunks was empty (no-chunk diagnostic)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5c607f51abd7269d705622c1ea2a9ab237282721","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/git/trees/5c607f51abd7269d705622c1ea2a9ab237282721"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/git/commits/b1d57e8d45f0dacc54e4993f786f9771d2cda209","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232647723?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dgocta","id":232647723,"login":"dgocta","node_id":"U_kgDODd3sKw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/commit/b1d57e8d45f0dacc54e4993f786f9771d2cda209","node_id":"C_kwDOSbFEkdoAKGIxZDU3ZThkNDVmMGRhY2M1NGU0OTkzZjc4NmY5NzcxZDJjZGEyMDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/commit/8b15e1cb0845ad57867dae5468869c554c7ab6d6","sha":"8b15e1cb0845ad57867dae5468869c554c7ab6d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/commits/8b15e1cb0845ad57867dae5468869c554c7ab6d6"}],"sha":"b1d57e8d45f0dacc54e4993f786f9771d2cda209","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/commits/b1d57e8d45f0dacc54e4993f786f9771d2cda209"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232647723?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dgocta","id":232647723,"login":"dgocta","node_id":"U_kgDODd3sKw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/commits/8b15e1cb0845ad57867dae5468869c554c7ab6d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-27T05:41:15Z","email":"dhruv.garg@salescode.ai","name":"dgocta"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-27T05:41:15Z","email":"dhruv.garg@salescode.ai","name":"dgocta"},"message":"fix guardrail blocking queries answered by keyword retrieval\n\nTwo bugs combined to drop \"dispute resolution\" queries:\n1. candidates[0] is always the first dense chunk — keyword chunks appended\n   after never influenced the threshold check.\n2. Keyword chunks carry score=0.25, below SIMILARITY_THRESHOLD=0.3, so even\n   checking max score would still fire the fallback.\n\nFix: bypass the score threshold entirely when keyword retrieval found hits.\nExact substring match is definitive proof the topic exists in the documents.\nOnly fall back when BOTH dense score is low AND keyword search is empty.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5d6058ff599bcc47f1235d9e6d8665c54b472465","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/git/trees/5d6058ff599bcc47f1235d9e6d8665c54b472465"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/git/commits/8b15e1cb0845ad57867dae5468869c554c7ab6d6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232647723?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dgocta","id":232647723,"login":"dgocta","node_id":"U_kgDODd3sKw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/commit/8b15e1cb0845ad57867dae5468869c554c7ab6d6","node_id":"C_kwDOSbFEkdoAKDhiMTVlMWNiMDg0NWFkNTc4NjdkYWU1NDY4ODY5YzU1NGM3YWI2ZDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/commit/82c262c3188fe1434fae46fd795a2eca3fe3e7a6","sha":"82c262c3188fe1434fae46fd795a2eca3fe3e7a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/commits/82c262c3188fe1434fae46fd795a2eca3fe3e7a6"}],"sha":"8b15e1cb0845ad57867dae5468869c554c7ab6d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/commits/8b15e1cb0845ad57867dae5468869c554c7ab6d6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232647723?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dgocta","id":232647723,"login":"dgocta","node_id":"U_kgDODd3sKw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/commits/82c262c3188fe1434fae46fd795a2eca3fe3e7a6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-27T05:37:48Z","email":"dhruv.garg@salescode.ai","name":"dgocta"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-27T05:37:48Z","email":"dhruv.garg@salescode.ai","name":"dgocta"},"message":"fix over-eager meta-query detection blocking content questions\n\n\"what are the sbi health insurance policies\" was matching \"are the polic*\"\nand routing to the KB inventory path instead of real retrieval.\n\nFix: if the query contains a specific insurer name (sbi, star, hdfc, etc.)\nit is always a content question — return False immediately.\nAlso removed the over-broad \"are the {noun}\" pattern that caused the false positive.\n13 test cases all pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"074aff6caf09a8a66fc7a0b0c50c543f1427831f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/git/trees/074aff6caf09a8a66fc7a0b0c50c543f1427831f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/git/commits/82c262c3188fe1434fae46fd795a2eca3fe3e7a6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232647723?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dgocta","id":232647723,"login":"dgocta","node_id":"U_kgDODd3sKw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/commit/82c262c3188fe1434fae46fd795a2eca3fe3e7a6","node_id":"C_kwDOSbFEkdoAKDgyYzI2MmMzMTg4ZmUxNDM0ZmFlNDZmZDc5NWEyZWNhM2ZlM2U3YTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/commit/68b207cfb5ee0abd506487c9b55a2f44d087bb8e","sha":"68b207cfb5ee0abd506487c9b55a2f44d087bb8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/commits/68b207cfb5ee0abd506487c9b55a2f44d087bb8e"}],"sha":"82c262c3188fe1434fae46fd795a2eca3fe3e7a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/commits/82c262c3188fe1434fae46fd795a2eca3fe3e7a6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232647723?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dgocta","id":232647723,"login":"dgocta","node_id":"U_kgDODd3sKw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/commits/68b207cfb5ee0abd506487c9b55a2f44d087bb8e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-27T05:33:38Z","email":"dhruv.garg@salescode.ai","name":"dgocta"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-27T05:33:38Z","email":"dhruv.garg@salescode.ai","name":"dgocta"},"message":"fix meta-query detection to handle natural language variations\n\nPrevious pattern list missed \"what are the companies you have insurance\ndata for\" because it only matched \"what companies\" not \"what are the companies\".\n\nReplace rigid phrase list with a multi-signal approach:\n- \"you have / do you have\" + any KB noun (company, insurer, policy, etc.)\n- token-level: intent word + company/insurer token\n- stem-based fallbacks: \"what are the compan*\", \"list of insur*\", etc.\n\n10 test cases all pass (meta vs policy questions).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"08f30107667a62489554a0402e13480e46f93458","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/git/trees/08f30107667a62489554a0402e13480e46f93458"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/git/commits/68b207cfb5ee0abd506487c9b55a2f44d087bb8e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232647723?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dgocta","id":232647723,"login":"dgocta","node_id":"U_kgDODd3sKw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/commit/68b207cfb5ee0abd506487c9b55a2f44d087bb8e","node_id":"C_kwDOSbFEkdoAKDY4YjIwN2NmYjVlZTBhYmQ1MDY0ODdjOWI1NWEyZjQ0ZDA4N2JiOGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/commit/f6e8347a242c89477496d450663c36b0154ce1a3","sha":"f6e8347a242c89477496d450663c36b0154ce1a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/commits/f6e8347a242c89477496d450663c36b0154ce1a3"}],"sha":"68b207cfb5ee0abd506487c9b55a2f44d087bb8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/commits/68b207cfb5ee0abd506487c9b55a2f44d087bb8e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232647723?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dgocta","id":232647723,"login":"dgocta","node_id":"U_kgDODd3sKw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/commits/f6e8347a242c89477496d450663c36b0154ce1a3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-27T05:29:38Z","email":"dhruv.garg@salescode.ai","name":"dgocta"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-27T05:29:38Z","email":"dhruv.garg@salescode.ai","name":"dgocta"},"message":"handle knowledge-base meta-questions before retrieval pipeline\n\nQueries like \"which company insurance do you have\" have no matching\nchunks in the vector store, so the similarity guardrail was firing and\nreturning the fallback answer before the LLM ever ran.\n\nFix: detect meta-queries (which/what company/policies/documents) and\nshort-circuit directly to the LLM with the indexed sources list,\nbypassing retrieval and the score threshold entirely.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7ff44e655f8a9909c9beb5a9544f0ef4b8a083bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/git/trees/7ff44e655f8a9909c9beb5a9544f0ef4b8a083bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/git/commits/f6e8347a242c89477496d450663c36b0154ce1a3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verifi