gocta"},"message":"Deploy: section-aware chroma_db with SBI PDF and watermark-filtered chunks\n\n387 chunks across 3 PDFs:\n- Star Health Assure: 185 chunks (GENERAL)\n- Group Health Insurance: 111 chunks (GENERAL + HOSPITALISATION EVALUATION)\n- SBI Health Insurance: 91 chunks (EXCLUSIONS: 78, DEFINITIONS: 34, GENERAL: 3)\n\nSBI PDF now permanently included in data/\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b0b1c4abf6c93c2de4697e8748ca9d9bd97f7c2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/git/trees/b0b1c4abf6c93c2de4697e8748ca9d9bd97f7c2f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/git/commits/18f02c56413f6e698d1027b78c06a9749921f8c4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232647723?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dgocta","id":232647723,"login":"dgocta","node_id":"U_kgDODd3sKw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/commit/18f02c56413f6e698d1027b78c06a9749921f8c4","node_id":"C_kwDOSbFEkdoAKDE4ZjAyYzU2NDEzZjZlNjk4ZDEwMjdiNzhjMDZhOTc0OTkyMWY4YzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/commit/8a9e8f70895ef9b09e3d36b8fb3d968bf73006b4","sha":"8a9e8f70895ef9b09e3d36b8fb3d968bf73006b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/commits/8a9e8f70895ef9b09e3d36b8fb3d968bf73006b4"}],"sha":"18f02c56413f6e698d1027b78c06a9749921f8c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/commits/18f02c56413f6e698d1027b78c06a9749921f8c4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232647723?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dgocta","id":232647723,"login":"dgocta","node_id":"U_kgDODd3sKw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/commits/8a9e8f70895ef9b09e3d36b8fb3d968bf73006b4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T10:58:53Z","email":"dhruv.garg@salescode.ai","name":"dgocta"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T10:58:53Z","email":"dhruv.garg@salescode.ai","name":"dgocta"},"message":"Add section-aware chunking, unstructured.io extraction, and guaranteed keyword retrieval\n\n- src/ingest.py: Complete rewrite using unstructured.partition_pdf (strategy=fast)\n  with pypdf fallback. Section-aware chunking tags every chunk with section\n  metadata (EXCLUSIONS, DEFINITIONS, GENERAL) detected from all-caps keyword\n  headers. Fixed plural regex (EXCLUSIONS?/DEFINITIONS?/CONDITIONS?) and\n  watermark filter (unique-word ratio < 0.40). Chunk IDs now include block\n  index (source-pPAGE-bBLOCK-cCHUNK) to avoid collisions when one page has\n  multiple section blocks.\n\n- src/chat.py: Keyword-matched chunks now guaranteed to reach the LLM even\n  when the MS MARCO cross-encoder demotes exclusion-section content below TOP_K.\n  kw_chunks that are not in the reranked top-K are appended directly.\n\n- src/retrieve.py: keyword_retrieve default k raised from 3 to 8 so all PDFs\n  are covered when multiple documents contain the same search term.\n\n- requirements.txt: Added unstructured[pdf]>=0.12.0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a13e6bb9fd7ef682ce7326a3790cd21712923c7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/git/trees/a13e6bb9fd7ef682ce7326a3790cd21712923c7e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/git/commits/8a9e8f70895ef9b09e3d36b8fb3d968bf73006b4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232647723?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dgocta","id":232647723,"login":"dgocta","node_id":"U_kgDODd3sKw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscr