pe":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/commits/5871a46d0403efd028a912e1142a4c381d634476/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T07:49:26Z","email":"dhruv.garg@salescode.ai","name":"dgocta"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T07:49:26Z","email":"dhruv.garg@salescode.ai","name":"dgocta"},"message":"fix: handle exclusion clauses, extract specific figures, widen retrieval\n\nsrc/chat.py — system prompt improvements:\n- Rule 1: if context shows something is excluded, state the exclusion clearly\n  instead of returning the generic \"I don''t have information\" fallback\n- Rule 2: always extract exact numbers, percentages, rupee amounts verbatim\n  from context rather than paraphrasing\n\nsrc/config.py — wider retrieval net for edge cases like exclusion clauses:\n- RETRIEVE_K: 15 → 20 (more first-stage candidates per query variant)\n- MULTI_QUERY_UNION_K: 15 → 20 (larger union before reranking)\n- SIMILARITY_THRESHOLD: 0.4 → 0.3 (don''t drop low-similarity chunks\n  that may still contain the relevant exclusion clause)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6ae5e08ff26dd2e9b318c9c927c77ef9bfe1b011","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/git/trees/6ae5e08ff26dd2e9b318c9c927c77ef9bfe1b011"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/git/commits/5871a46d0403efd028a912e1142a4c381d634476","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232647723?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta