ery RAG, metadata injection, RAGAS eval\n\n- src/config.py: CHUNK_SIZE 500→200, CHUNK_OVERLAP 50→20, RETRIEVE_K 10→15,\n  RETRIEVAL_STRATEGY default set to multi_query\n- src/retrieve.py: add get_indexed_sources() to read document names from\n  Chroma metadata; add retrieve_multi_query() for union-dedup retrieval\n- src/chat.py: inject indexed document names into SYSTEM_PROMPT at startup\n  so LLM can answer meta-questions and cross-document comparisons\n- eval/test_set.json: expand to 20 harder questions (cross-doc comparisons,\n  recommendations, meta-questions)\n- eval/run_eval.py: fix RAGAS API — use singleton metrics compatible with\n  evaluate(), remove ResponseRelevancy and embedding_factory dependencies\n- eval/results.json: RAGAS scores on 20-question set (faithfulness=0.638,\n  context_precision=0.651, context_recall=0.775)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1210ae2baae6a86b9150ef2975b2c093554c7385","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/git/trees/1210ae2baae6a86b9150ef2975b2c093554c7385"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/git/commits/39b9b0e76ac50b5ebf27aa830a37fbca582805d2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232647723?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dgocta","id":232647723,"login":"dgocta","node_id":"U_kgDODd3sKw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/repos","site_a