octa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dgocta","id":232647723,"login":"dgocta","node_id":"U_kgDODd3sKw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/commits/089ff2d93949440967ded60dc6dfb68614dc10e9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T05:59:35Z","email":"dhruv.garg@salescode.ai","name":"dgocta"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T05:59:35Z","email":"dhruv.garg@salescode.ai","name":"dgocta"},"message":"feat: migrate from Google Gemini to OpenAI (gpt-4o-mini + text-embedding-3-small)\n\nReplaces all google-genai SDK calls with the openai SDK:\n- Embeddings: gemini-embedding-2 → text-embedding-3-small (1536-dim, true batch support)\n- LLM: gemini-2.0-flash-lite → gpt-4o-mini (500 RPM, no daily cap, ~$0.00042/query)\n- Removes per-text embedding loop workaround — OpenAI accepts list input natively\n- EMBED_BATCH_SIZE raised to 100, sleep reduced to 0.5s (generous rate limits)\n- Cross-encoder reranker, Chroma, Streamlit UI and Dialogflow webhook unchanged\n\nMotivation: Gemini free-tier daily quotas (20-1500 RPD depending on model)\nwere exhausted. OpenAI paid tier has no daily caps.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d9c1ad59a9d874a6e4518f2e87a07afa4ec9344b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/git/trees/d9c1ad59a9d874a6e4518f2e87a07afa4ec9344b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/droo