e":"dgocta"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T13:08:24Z","email":"dhruv.garg@salescode.ai","name":"dgocta"},"message":"feat: EXL-specific UX improvements (escalation, IRDAI, confidence, transcript)\n\n- Human escalation: fallback answer now includes helpline number and hours\n  so out-of-scope queries hand off to a specialist rather than dead-ending\n- IRDAI disclaimer: footer on every page satisfies Indian insurance compliance\n  requirement that AI-generated responses be clearly labelled\n- Confidence band: citations show High/Medium/Low instead of raw cosine score,\n  making retrieval quality readable to non-technical users\n- Download transcript: sidebar button exports the full conversation as .txt,\n  matching contact-centre logging requirements\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"38944feda6622673e39db006646585bff97cb58e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/git/trees/38944feda6622673e39db006646585bff97cb58e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/git/commits/2be6d6274cb9a3329cae7a74d8f5c6a769be1a6a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232647723?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dgocta","id":232647723,"login":"dgocta","node_id":"U_kgDODd3sKw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/starr