"name":"dgocta"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T13:02:56Z","email":"dhruv.garg@salescode.ai","name":"dgocta"},"message":"feat: add cross-encoder reranker (two-stage retrieval pipeline)\n\nBi-encoder retrieval now fetches RETRIEVE_K=10 candidates from Chroma\n(wider net for recall), then cross-encoder/ms-marco-MiniLM-L-6-v2\nreranks them and cuts to TOP_K=3 for the LLM prompt (precision).\n\nSimilarity threshold check still runs on bi-encoder scores before the\nreranker, so out-of-domain queries short-circuit without paying for the\ncross-encoder forward pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2fa8c550641d0a240a1ee78381e89145876578a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/git/trees/2fa8c550641d0a240a1ee78381e89145876578a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/git/commits/094e5236d8c21d0de3ea422b70b9b50b1adfa86b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232647723?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dgocta","id":232647723,"login":"dgocta","node_id":"U_kgDODd3sKw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/commit/094e5236d8c21d0de3ea422b70b9b50b1adfa86b","node_id":"C_kwDOSbFEkdoAKDA5NGU1MjM2ZDhjMjFkMGRlM2VhNDIyYjcwYjliNTBiMWFkZmE4NmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/commit/75047a33ad488a40f78ea11843410ebcdb13e83f","sha":"75047a33ad488a40f78ea11843410ebcdb13e83f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/commits/75047a33ad488a40f78ea11843410ebcdb13e83f"}],"sha":"094e5236d8c21d0de3ea422b70b9b50b1adfa86b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/commits/094e5236d8c21d0de3ea422b70b9b50b1adfa86b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232647723?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dgocta","id":232647723,"login":"dgocta","node_id":"U_kgDODd3sKw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/commits/75047a33ad488a40f78ea11843410ebcdb13e83f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-13T12:59:19Z","email":"dhruv.garg@salescode.ai","name":"dgocta"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T12:59:19Z","email":"dhruv.garg@salescode.ai","name":"dgocta"},"message":"feat: allow users to upload PDFs via UI sidebar\n\nAdds ingest_pdf_bytes() to src/ingest.py so any PDF can be ingested at\nruntime without re-running the offline pipeline. The Streamlit sidebar\nexposes a file uploader that calls it directly — uploaded chunks are\npersisted to Chroma immediately and available to the retrieval layer on\nthe next query. HF Spaces disclaimer included since uploads are\nsession-scoped (container restart resets the disk).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7ab6fc2df253393b6f8d824bd80bdc37c66ea82a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/git/trees/7ab6fc2df253393b6f8d824bd80bdc37c66ea82a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/git/commits/75047a33ad488a40f78ea11843410ebcdb13e83f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232647723?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dgocta","id":232647723,"login":"dgocta","node_id":"U_kgDODd3sKw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgocta","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/drooph0904/conversational-ai-assistant/commit/75047a33ad488a40f78ea11843410ebcdb13e83f","node_id":"C_kwDOSbFEkdoAKDc1MDQ3YTMzYWQ0ODhhNDBmNzhlYTExODQzNDEwZWJjZGIxM2U4M2Y"