nder row locks and self-heals\n  already-stranded ones.\n- Guest and superadmin cancellation of a pending booking now release the coupon too.\n- Booking.release_coupon() is the single implementation (expire_if_needed, release_hold).\n- apply_coupon_to_booking now rejects a booking owned by another user, matching\n  remove_coupon_from_booking.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8435f9472ebcc15babb42b2fa8d438a02792bb8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sukheshkanna13/TTR-V2/git/trees/8435f9472ebcc15babb42b2fa8d438a02792bb8d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sukheshkanna13/TTR-V2/git/commits/e9c26fded9101bc1ea52772b2ad0c8dce3e5f3a8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115562434?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sukheshkanna13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sukheshkanna13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sukheshkanna13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sukheshkanna13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sukheshkanna13","id":115562434,"login":"Sukheshkanna13","node_id":"U_kgDOBuNXwg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sukheshkanna13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sukheshkanna13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sukheshkanna13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sukheshkanna13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sukheshkanna13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sukheshkanna13","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sukheshkanna13/TTR-V2/commit/e9c26fded9101bc1ea52772b2ad0c8dce3e5f3a8","node_id":"C_kwDOSbFpxtoAKGU5YzI2ZmRlZDkxMDFiYzFlYTUyNzcyYjJhZDBjOGRjZTNlNWYzYTg","parents":[