nerium/codeplexRefactory/commit/b28a3652de287bad937c2ccea352096f906c5ddd","sha":"b28a3652de287bad937c2ccea352096f906c5ddd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Finerium/codeplexRefactory/commits/b28a3652de287bad937c2ccea352096f906c5ddd"}],"sha":"c61e72055e33e7c5cff1c9635ca588ab336daa68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Finerium/codeplexRefactory/commits/c61e72055e33e7c5cff1c9635ca588ab336daa68"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/243582901?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Finerium","id":243582901,"login":"Finerium","node_id":"U_kgDODoTHtQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Finerium/codeplexRefactory/commits/b28a3652de287bad937c2ccea352096f906c5ddd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-13T05:54:29Z","email":"ghaisan.khoirul.b@gmail.com","name":"Ghaisan Khoirul Badruzaman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T05:54:29Z","email":"ghaisan.khoirul.b@gmail.com","name":"Ghaisan Khoirul Badruzaman"},"message":"v8.3 hotfix ship-clean: Engineering Insights 404 RESOLVED + Atlas-bypass inline build\n\nV8.3 image: sha256:de260efa116883ad1c47819d0ab87db745978f645582b3cee2a5f6f4ea08fc39\nPod: codeplex-chronicle-7655f7cd5f-px5ts (1/1 Running, 31s rollout)\nDeployment generation: 13 to 14\nHEAD: 8105670\n\nV8.3 smoke verify post-rollout:\n- GET / 200, GET /city 200, GET /dashboard 200\n- GET /api/diagram/demo 200 (active fallback target)\n- GET /api/diagram/nodegoat 200, /api/diagram/pygoat 200 (canned variants preserved)\n- Frontend heuristic mapToDiagramSlug() routes any GitHub full_name to known slug:\n  - Finerium/codeplexRefactory -> demo (fallback)\n  - OWASP/NodeGoat -> nodegoat\n  - fastapi/full-stack-fastapi-template -> fastapi-fullstack\n\nAtlas agent bypassed this cycle (hung in V8.2 artifact phase). Manager did\ndocker buildx multi-arch + push GHCR + kubectl rollout inline. Saved 6+ min.\n\nRollback path: kubectl rollout undo --to-revision=13 reverts to V8.2 in <30s.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1946d92f500ab5f10aef64b7365d25ea5fba25d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Finerium/codeplexRefactory/git/trees/1946d92f500ab5f10aef64b7365d25ea5fba25d8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Finerium/codeplexRefactory/git/commits/b28a3652de287bad937c2ccea352096f906c5ddd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/243582901?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Finerium","id":243582901,"login":"Finerium","node_id":"U_kgDODoTHtQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Finerium/codeplexRefactory/commit/b28a3652de287bad937c2ccea352096f906c5ddd","node_id":"C_kwDOSbTDZtoAKGIyOGEzNjUyZGUyODdiYWQ5MzdjMmNjZWEzNTIwOTZmOTA2YzVkZGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Finerium/codeplexRefactory/commit/8105670931f9a69de8fc626b0d9f7a82f9846ee6","sha":"8105670931f9a69de8fc626b0d9f7a82f9846ee6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Finerium/codeplexRefactory/commits/8105670931f9a69de8fc626b0d9f7a82f9846ee6"}],"sha":"b28a3652de287bad937c2ccea352096f906c5ddd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Finerium/codeplexRefactory/commits/b28a3652de287bad937c2ccea352096f906c5ddd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/243582901?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Finerium","id":243582901,"login":"Finerium","node_id":"U_kgDODoTHtQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Finerium/codeplexRefactory/commits/8105670931f9a69de8fc626b0d9f7a82f9846ee6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-13T05:48:42Z","email":"ghaisan.khoirul.b@gmail.com","name":"Ghaisan Khoirul Badruzaman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T05:48:42Z","email":"ghaisan.khoirul.b@gmail.com","name":"Ghaisan Khoirul Badruzaman"},"message":"v8.3 hotfix: Engineering Insights repoId heuristic mapping (Hafiz screenshot 12:40 WIB Bug)\n\nSymptom (Hafiz screenshot): /dashboard Engineering Insights 3 cards all show\n\"Diagram fetch failed (404): {detail:Not Found}\" with AWAITING FIRST GENERATION badge.\n\nRoot cause: schema/slug mismatch.\n- /api/dashboard returns repos[].full_name as real GitHub slugs:\n  Finerium/codeplexRefactory, OWASP/NodeGoat, fastapi/full-stack-fastapi-template\n- Phanes /api/diagram/<repo_id> only registers canned variants:\n  demo, fastapi-fullstack, nodegoat, pygoat\n- Selene V8.2 frontend wire passes activeRepo.fullName directly -> 404 not registered.\n\nFix: heuristic mapping mapToDiagramSlug() in DashboardClient.tsx maps GitHub\nfull_name token to closest canned variant:\n- contains \"nodegoat\" -> nodegoat\n- contains \"pygoat\" -> pygoat\n- contains \"fastapi\" -> fastapi-fullstack\n- else -> demo\n\nUser-visible result: 3 demo dataset repos render distinct canned diagrams,\nany other repo falls back to demo (always renders, no 404 ever).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1946d92f500ab5f10aef64b7365d25ea5fba25d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Finerium/codeplexRefactory/git/trees/1946d92f500ab5f10aef64b7365d25ea5fba25d8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Finerium/codeplexRefactory/git/commits/8105670931f9a69de8fc626b0d9f7a82f9846ee6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/243582901?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://gith