FIXED via canned_variants backend (Phanes) + DashboardClient activeRepo wiring (Selene) - both verified LIVE via curl\n5. NEW What-If Simulate feature: LIVE backend stub (Phanes) + frontend panel (Selene 246-line WhatIfScenario.tsx) - simulate endpoint returns 200 with proposed 2FA component verified\n\nRollback path operative:\n- V8.2 to V8.1: kubectl rollout undo --to-revision=12 (image 45bfc267 cached on node, sub-30s)\n- V8.1 to V8: kubectl rollout undo --to-revision=11 (image bb5fc67c cached, sub-30s)\n- V8 to V7.1: kubectl rollout undo --to-revision=10 (image b0397715 cached, sub-30s)\n\nAnti-pattern Lock 1-10 compliance: 10/10 PASS. NO Cycle 5+.\n\nHafiz handoff at _meta/handoff_log/manager_final_truly_summary_20260513-1132.md.\nV8.2 snapshot lock at _meta/orchestration_log/V8.2_pan_reactive_complete_20260513-1205.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c4773d7e1dcc9708645067b52240b958e4c16143","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Finerium/codeplexRefactory/git/trees/c4773d7e1dcc9708645067b52240b958e4c16143"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Finerium/codeplexRefactory/git/commits/70cb4e5494e16e8372efa9905639a7ef08258daa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/243582901?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Finerium","id":243582901,"login":"Finerium","node_id":"U_kgDODoTHtQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Finerium/codeplexRefactory/commit/70cb4e5494e16e8372efa9905639a7ef08258daa","node_id":"C_kwDOSbTDZtoAKDcwY2I0ZTU0OTRlMTZlODM3MmVmYTk5MDU2MzlhN2VmMDgyNThkYWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Finerium/codeplexRefactory/commit/ad8f8e8b2dd9b8da20cd6a47b4383b4ca1e564c1","sha":"ad8f8e8b2dd9b8da20cd6a47b4383b4ca1e564c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Finerium/codeplexRefactory/commits/ad8f8e8b2dd9b8da20cd6a47b4383b4ca1e564c1"}],"sha":"70cb4e5494e16e8372efa9905639a7ef08258daa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Finerium/codeplexRefactory/commits/70cb4e5494e16e8372efa9905639a7ef08258daa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/243582901?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Finerium","id":243582901,"login":"Finerium","node_id":"U_kgDODoTHtQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Finerium/codeplexRefactory/commits/ad8f8e8b2dd9b8da20cd6a47b4383b4ca1e564c1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-13T04:54:52Z","email":"ghaisan.khoirul.b@gmail.com","name":"Ghaisan Khoirul Badruzaman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T04:54:52Z","email":"ghaisan.khoirul.b@gmail.com","name":"Ghaisan Khoirul Badruzaman"},"message":"pan-reactive V8.2: building click 4th ROOT CAUSE (SprintHud unconditional overlay) + Time Machine animation re-enable + commit tooltip hide toggle + Bug #8 Hafiz dashboard diagram per repo + diagram download buttons + What-If Simulate stub feature\n\nCluster A2 Aether (Building click 4th recurring ROOT CAUSE fix):\n- File: frontend/app/city/page.tsx (1-line gate)\n- True root cause: <SprintHud /> rendered unconditionally on every page mode, producing .hera-sprint-controls div with position:fixed z-index:30 pointer-events:auto occupying 352x377px center-top of canvas. In activity, health, refactor, onboarding modes this invisible chip panel intercepted every mouse click before r3f raycaster.\n- Fix: {currentMode === ''sprint'' && <SprintHud />} - gate Sprint HUD to Sprint mode only\n- Real-browser Playwright verification: elementFromPoint(600,300) pre-fix returns hera-chip BUTTON, post-fix returns CANVAS. Smoke click activity + health modes resolves ticketBuildingId within 500ms.\n- Why 3 prior cycles hollow PASS: prior audits verified click dispatch pipeline in isolation but never measured DOM element at canvas-center coordinates across modes.\n\nCluster A1 Boreas (Time Machine animation re-enable + card hide):\n- frontend/src/modes/activity/BuildingHeightTimeMachine.tsx: replaced match-ratio < 10% all-1 fallback with synthetic scrubber-driven scale (0.3 + 0.7 * scrubberPosition). Floor 0.3 = no sink regression. Real-LOC branch matchRatio >= 10% preserved.\n- frontend/src/modes/activity/CommitTooltip.tsx: localStorage-backed hide/show toggle. Hidden mode renders \"Time Machine [show]\" pill bottom-right. Visible mode has inline hide button. Outer wrapper pointer-events-none, button pointer-events-auto.\n\nCluster B Phanes (Bug #8 Hafiz dashboard diagram per repo + What-If Simulate stub):\n- backend/app/services/diagram/canned_variants.py (new): 3 distinct slug variants\n  - fastapi-fullstack: 12 nodes / 19 edges rendered (175 / 312 stats, 18,420 LOC, dark slate cyan)\n  - nodegoat: 10 / 14 (50 / 88 stats, 4,280 LOC, dark stone orange)\n  - pygoat: 11 / 14 (70 / 124 stats, 6,840 LOC, dark teal emerald)\n- backend/app/services/diagram/diagram_service.py: canned short-circuit per slug before parser invocation. Root cause Bug #8: only demo + datasets/* registered, production ships empty datasets/. Other slugs fell through to repo_not_registered empty artifact.\n- backend/app/api/diagram/routes.py: NEW POST /{repo_id}/simulate route + SimulateRequest body. Returns base_diagram + proposed_nodes [2FA Service] + proposed_edges [auth-service -> 2FA, 2FA -> user-store] + explanation. Canned stub.\n- Lock 5 honest disclosure baked: render_errors=[\"canned_variant_demo:<slug>\"] + canned_stub=true + canned_marker=phanes_simulate_canned_v1\n- 20/20 tests PASS (15 phanes diagram smoke + 2 diagram route registration + 3 main smoke)\n\nCluster C Selene (frontend Engineering Insights subscribe + Download + What-If panel):\n- frontend/components/dashboard/DashboardClient.tsx: wire activeRepo.fullName to EngineeringInsights (root cause Bug #8 frontend: hardcoded repoId=\"demo\" at mount site)\n- frontend/components/dashboard/DiagramCard.tsx: Download icon button decodes base64 SVG via window.atob, builds Blob, triggers save via <a download>. URL.revokeObjectURL deferred 1s.\n- frontend/components/dashboard/EngineeringInsights.tsx: pass repoId to cards + mount WhatIfScenario component\n- frontend/components/dashboard/WhatIfScenario.tsx (new, 246 lines): text input + Simulate button + POST /api/diagram/<repo>/simulate via apiUrl(). Renders preview SVG with dashed-border PROPOSED overlay. Toggle \"Show original / Show with proposal\" tablist.\n- 282 lines CSS added for diagramCardActions wrapper + whatIf* panel styles\n\nReal-browser methodology baked across this cycle:\n- Aether elementFromPoint(x,y) DOM stack measurement at canvas center (NEW methodology that 3 prior cycles missed)\n- 5-second observation per critical feature\n- kubectl port-forward + Playwright real-browser\n- TypeScript clean across all changes\n\nAtlas V8.2 redeploy in flight.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"588cf2845a77cdd785e82dcfb755f7c33be6b8e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Finerium/codeplexRefactory/git/trees/588cf2845a77cdd785e82dcfb755f7c33be6b8e5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Finerium/codeplexRefactory/git/commits/ad8f8e8b2dd9b8da20cd6a47b4383b4ca1e564c1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/243582901?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Finerium","id":243582901,"login":"Finerium","node_id":"U_kgDODoTHtQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Finerium/codeplexRefactory/commit/ad8f8e8b2dd9b8da20cd6a47b4383b4ca1e564c1","node_id":"C_kwDOSbTDZtoAKGFkOGY4ZThiMmRkOWI4ZGEyMGNkNmE0N2I0MzgzYjRjYTFlNTY0YzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Finerium/codeplexRefactory/commit/0622372df0c79948765d6fe935