ents/marketing/TechStackSection.tsx (new) + page.tsx + marketing.css\n- 10 stack tokens in 2 columns (Runtime + Intelligence)\n\nCluster 8 Asclepius (Refactor dual review gate UI):\n- frontend/components/panels/side/RefactorReviewVariant.tsx + refactorClient.ts\n- Always-visible Dual review gate preview with 3 buttons (Run Simulation + Accept Changes + Discard)\n- Run Simulation auto-loads MOCK_PROPOSAL + dispatches triggerSimulate with mock pump fallback\n- refactorClient.ts migrated URLs to apiUrl helper for ConfigMap-drift defense\n- AD-19 safety preserved: production code untouched\n\nCluster 11 Persephone (Onboarding HUD tab):\n- frontend/components/panels/side/SidePanel.tsx\n- Added Onboarding as first TabsTrigger\n- onVariantSwitch routes Onboarding to setMode(''onboarding''), triggers OnboardingHud overlay\n- PRD Section 15 demo flow step 4 unblocked\n\nCluster 3 Pan (comprehensive 62-feature audit verdict matrix):\n- _meta/audit/manager_final_truly_comprehensive_audit_20260513-1048.md\n- 23 PASS-REAL + 22 PASS-MOCKUP-OK + 11 FAIL-NEEDS-FIX + 6 DEFER\n- Top 5 critical FAILs identified and dispatched\n\nReal-browser methodology UPGRADE vs Cycle 1-3 hollow ship pattern:\n- 5-second observation per critical feature MINIMUM\n- Real pointer events where TLS permits\n- MIXED-METHODOLOGY fallback (curl + bundle grep + code trace) honest disclosure\n- Network + console continuous monitoring\n\nGhaisan TRULY FINAL Day 2 QA satisfaction:\n- Time Machine 0.5s sink: FIXED via match-ratio graceful degradation\n- Repo render reliability: FIXED via pre-cache + idempotent deepen\n- Building count = file count: ADDRESSED via 3 demo variants (Wave 3 real-data swap roadmap)\n- User Tutor relaunch CTA: SHIPPED on Landing hero\n\nCluster 12 Atlas V8 redeploy + Aether+Pan final dual audit pending next commit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"16d434a984b2ef3b8b1b9788e82b7798e71713c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Finerium/codeplexRef