nerium/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Finerium","id":243582901,"login":"Finerium","node_id":"U_kgDODoTHtQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Finerium/codeplexRefactory/commits/db9d73f573cec6b9ccad544a6a16fa669b7c2b78/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-13T03:07:01Z","email":"ghaisan.khoirul.b@gmail.com","name":"Ghaisan Khoirul Badruzaman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T03:07:01Z","email":"ghaisan.khoirul.b@gmail.com","name":"Ghaisan Khoirul Badruzaman"},"message":"manager-final-cycle3 V7.1 emergency hotfix: Time Machine direction flip + buildings restore\n\nGhaisan QA 10:01 WIB surface: Time Machine logic inverted + ALL buildings disappeared in Activity Mode.\n\nRoot cause (analysis 6 min recon):\n- store.ts:41 defaults scrubberPosition: 1.0 with comment \"now (right edge)\"\n- BUT useTimeMachine.ts + TimelineScrubber.tsx mapped position 0 = NOW (endMs), position 1 = past (startMs)\n- Default 1.0 maps to 90d AGO = LOC 0 for most files = building height 0 = invisible\n- Plus inverted from Ghaisan Cycle 2 vision verbatim: drag KIRI = building shorter LOC 0 past, drag KANAN = building taller LOC max NOW\n\nFix Cycle 3 hotfix Manager FINAL direct edit (5 files):\n- useTimeMachine.ts: cursorMs = startMs + scrubberPosition * rangeMs (flipped)\n- TimelineScrubber.tsx: mapping + marker ratio + tick mark ratio + anchor label LEFT/RIGHT swap + hint text \"Drag left toward past, right toward present\"\n- HotspotGlow.tsx: 2 cursorMs computations flipped (sliceIntensities + burstBuildingId)\n- store.ts: comment update (default 1.0 now correctly maps to NOW)\n- TimelineMarkers.tsx: already correct (line 92 startMs + position * rangeMs), no edit needed\n\nNet effect:\n- Default scrubberPosition 1.0 -> cursorMs = endMs = NOW (rightmost = present)\n- Buildings render at current LOC visible on Activity Mode mount\n- Drag LEFT direction toward 0 -> cursorMs approaches startMs (90d ago, past)\n- Drag RIGHT direction toward 1 -> cursorMs approaches endMs (NOW)\n- LEFT anchor label = Nd ago + startMs date\n- RIGHT anchor label = Now + endMs date\n- Marker dots positioned (timestamp - startMs) / rangeMs so older markers LEFT, newer RIGHT\n- Western timeline standard\n\ntsc exit 0 frontend full strict mode after edits.\n\nPlus T-CYCLE3-B buildings restored automatically (Default cursor = NOW = LOC current = buildings visible).\nPlus T-CYCLE3-C per-cursor commit popup ALREADY working in TimelineScrubber.tsx:432-466 nearestMarker logic.\n\nWall-clock Cycle 3: ~12 min (recon 6 min + edits 4 min + tsc + commit 2 min). Atlas redeploy pending.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a9d291728060bb498027273bbe940a6e2ad23600","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Finerium/codeplexRefactory/git/trees/a9d291728060bb498027273bbe940a6e2ad23600"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Finerium/codeplexRefactory/git/commits/db9d73f573cec6b9ccad544a6a16fa669b7c2b78","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/243582901?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/following{/other_user}",