age sha256:1aa68e47acef8473cd79f4abcf40e751552717f66dbc0c418456f99754e8ecd5 multi-arch amd64+arm64. Generation 8 to 9. Pod prsxn 1/1 Running. Cluster D LIVE 8 SSE types + 0 fallback (11533 bytes capture). Selene diagram 3/3 live. Triton V4-Flash 3634ms verified. Smoke 3x PASS.\n\nAether final audit: real-browser MCP per-bug verdict PASS + DEFERRED satisfied by Atlas redeploy. Pan final audit: SHIP CONDITIONAL on Atlas = SATISFIED. Both independent methodology converge SHIP verdict.\n\n68 source + 153 metadata file. 3405 insertions 548 deletions. Anti-pattern Locks 1-10 zero violation across all 14 worker artifacts + 2 audit reports + V7 snapshot.\n\nIssues DEFERRED to Pan post-cycle reactive: Issue B (MEDIUM) /dashboard ?repo= URL param, Issue A (LOW) /city repo=all 3x fetch, Sprint HUD canvas obstruction (LOW) Hera scope.\n\nV7 snapshot _meta/orchestration_log/V7_manager_final_cycle2_complete_20260513-0952.md (1500+ line).\n\nWall-clock 95 min vs 100 min ceiling = 95% used = ship-tight under cap.\n\nLessons captured 8 amplified + 9 + 10: GSAP fromTo invisible-during-animate explains Playwright PASS but human FAIL. Bug #7 compound 3-layer. Dual-audit independent methodology critical.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"da04efc59892b3ee8a0d9ce1c5ab7c5f31eadc77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Finerium/codeplexRefactory/git/trees/da04efc59892b3ee8a0d9ce1c5ab7c5f31eadc77"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Finerium/codeplexRefactory/git/commits/a381bb8da1d833f81332c03b531e0238d2ceeff7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/243582901?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github