tasks live stream\n- Simulation 3-turn drafts/ write AD-19 isolation property held\n- Demo seed 230 rows materialized views populated\n- Cost tracking real $0.003785 from 5 real V4-Pro+Flash calls\n\nReal-evidence verify (not body grep):\n- /api/llm/health calls_recorded > 0 + total_cost_usd > $0.001\n- /api/diagram/demo returns 200 JSON nodes + edges + svg_blobs\n- drafts/<sim-id>/ file write verified ls -la\n- 286 backend pytest PASS + 9/9 Phanes + 47/47 Nemesis + 128/128 Triton + 46/46 Demeter\n\nAnti-pattern Lock 1-10 zero violation. 14 worker mandatory artifacts (decision_log + uncertainty + checkpoint + handoff_log) + V5 snapshot per worker. STAMP=20260513-0342 WIB Day 2 dini hari.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4c5b6a78ed240133befc64918b7f3e3dcf322055","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Finerium/codeplexRefactory/git/trees/4c5b6a78ed240133befc64918b7f3e3dcf322055"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Finerium/codeplexRefactory/git/commits/d70c1053b08a5b4eba2a1f05f0e76b77326cfafa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/243582901?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Finerium","id":243582901,"login":"Finerium","node_id":"U_kgDODoTHtQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/subscript