 + Gin + Echo + Spring + Actix) + auth token window scan + public route allowlist + framework_unknown info finding.\n\nCycle 3 Apollo 4-5 + Argus real:\n- unsafe_sql: 9 SQL exec regex + concat heuristic + safe-token filter.\n- complex_untested: radon Python cyclomatic + decision token counter all langs + 14-path colocated test glob + McCabe academic thresholds.\n- argus_security: real Triton LLMGateway resident_id=\"argus\" thinking_mode=\"low\" + Argus persona prompt + JSON parse regex fallback + canned per-FindingCategory fallback on 401 / circuit-break.\n\nCycle 4-5 spec-drift A-E real impl on demo-drift fixture:\n- Pattern A stale_closed: IssueStore + closed > 6 months + file edits after close via commits_by_file.\n- Pattern B closed_without_merge: linked PR merge check + duplicate keyword skip.\n- Pattern C spec_impl_lag: positive lag close to last commit + NEMESIS_DRIFT_C_LAG_MONTHS env override threshold.\n- Pattern D reopened_cycle: reopened_count >= 2 + flake keyword skip + severity tiering.\n- Pattern E openspec_drift: openspec/archive walk + git log subprocess + opsx prefix check + IssueStore commits_by_file fallback + git_unavailable info event.\n\nPlus 3 supporting modules: osv_client.py + manifest_parser.py + issue_store.py.\n\n33/33 Nemesis tests PASS (14 cycle-1 dispatcher contract + 7 cycle-2 Apollo 1-3 real + 4 cycle-3 full Apollo real + 8 cycle-5 full drift real, 1 skipped offline). 224/224 full backend suite PASS no regression. Wall-clock cumulative ~37 min vs 6.7h Wave 3 budget = 9.2% used + 5h 53min buffer. V3 snapshot locked. 7 mandatory artifact + 11 decisions D-Nemesis-01 to D-Nemesis-11 + 11 medium concerns MC-01 to MC-11 in 2 uncertainty journal (no ferry). Aletheia audit checklist line 64-81 Nemesis scope ready for verification.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"675c46d67352ac1516230e0e365fdf3d6dae0bc2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Finerium/codeplexRefactory/git/trees/675c46d67352ac1516230e0