hub.com/users/Finerium/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Finerium","id":243582901,"login":"Finerium","node_id":"U_kgDODoTHtQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Finerium/codeplexRefactory/commits/d92cb4ed8774f420e7de2fc7b9521b3ff02fc8db/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T14:59:00Z","email":"ghaisan.khoirul.b@gmail.com","name":"Ghaisan Khoirul Badruzaman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T14:59:00Z","email":"ghaisan.khoirul.b@gmail.com","name":"Ghaisan Khoirul Badruzaman"},"message":"nemesis wave3 cycle 1 stub ship: 11 detector + dispatcher + 4 adapter + 14/14 smoke PASS\n\n5 Apollo detector (secrets, outdated_deps, missing_auth, unsafe_sql, complex_untested)\n+ Argus security CVSS enrich\n+ 5 spec-drift detector A-E (stale_closed, closed_without_merge, spec_impl_lag, reopened_cycle, openspec_drift)\n+ dispatcher single-entry run_full_scan orchestrator\n+ 4 adapter (Hades parser, Triton LLM, Demeter persist, WS publisher) with real-upstream delegation + graceful fallback.\n\n18 source file under backend/app/services/detectors/. Pydantic schemas verbatim Pythia\ncontracts (FindingPersist + DriftEventPersist + FindingEvent + CVSSScore + ApolloFinding\n+ DriftEvent + ScanResult). 5-enum severity + 5-enum kebab-case category + 5-enum A-E\npattern enforced via Pydantic Literal. camelCase wire format via Field alias.\n\n14/14 smoke test PASS (5 Apollo trigger, 5 drift trigger, Argus enrich 3 security\ncategories, WS lifecycle scan.started + 5 finding.detected + scan.completed, Demeter\nbuffer 5+5, all 4 enum lock compliance, camelCase wire format, adapter singleton\nidentity). 176/176 full backend test suite PASS no regression to Hades + Triton +\nPandora siblings.\n\nDrift algo decision doc 220 line at _meta/decisions/nemesis_drift_algo.md covers 5\npattern A-E algorithmic primary trigger + AST-diff inferred enrichment + 8 framework\ntree-sitter missing_auth + OSV API consumption per Phase B Topic 3c. Lock 4 + Lock 8\n+ Lock 5 honest claim discipline ([STUB cycle-1] labels inline).\n\n5 mandatory artifact + V3 snapshot locked. No ferry. Cycle 1 wall-clock ~22 min vs\n60-90 min budget.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d9ea88d941be0c0d385da438e7047248c558d119","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Finerium/codeplexRefactory/git/trees/d9ea88d941be0c0d385da438e7047248c558d119"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Finerium/codeplexRefactory/git/commits/d92cb4ed8774f420e7de2fc7b9521b3ff02fc8db","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/243582901?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Finerium","id":243582901,"login":"Finerium","node_id":"U_kgDODoTHtQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Finerium/st