https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-openrouter-companion/commits/b19bbea178105dcc80920c62ade2160dbd07cbb4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T13:12:22Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"NearlCrews"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T13:12:22Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"NearlCrews"},"message":"chore(package): keep the App Store recommendations to real pairings\n\n`signalk.recommends` fills the \"Works well with\" list, so every entry\nshould be a plugin an operator runs alongside this one for a reason the\ndata supports. Binnacle reads this plugin''s report notifications and\nfires its PUT handler, the weather sensors feed the forecast analyzer,\nthe NMEA 2000 emitter turns the notifications into helm alerts, and\nQuestDB and the two InfluxDB writers are the history sources the trend\nanalyzers query. Nothing flows either way between this plugin and\nsignalk-synthetic-values, so it comes off the list.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TrhyiHJbhmfXmLpqFFzeEY","tree":{"sha":"91100e3b349e1a46b63c0ed9ad4202afef912e0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-openrouter-companion/git/trees/91100e3b349e1a46b63c0ed9ad4202afef912e0f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-openrouter-companion/git/commits/b19bbea178105dcc80920c62ade2160dbd07cbb4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/g