"NearlCrews"},"message":"fix: drop the strict version check from the React singleton shares\n\nSignal K 2.24.0''s Admin bundles React 19.2.4 but registers its Module\nFederation shares with a hardcoded 19.0.0, so a strictVersion share\nrejects a fully compatible host. With import: false there is no local\nfallback, and the panel never mounts on those servers. The shares keep\nsingleton, requiredVersion ^19.2.0, and import: false; a mismatched\nregistration now warns and continues. The panel bundle check pins the\nnew shape and fails if strictVersion returns.","tree":{"sha":"bde76e7612d20fb547f9da94f4fc287e862ae342","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-openrouter-companion/git/trees/bde76e7612d20fb547f9da94f4fc287e862ae342"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-openrouter-companion/git/commits/338829afb90ed5045212a840cea7e72d164caccf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews/