h-priority/JS-ASYNC-DEEP.md: Promises internals, combinators, async/await edge cases,\n  generators, async generators, for-await-of, cancellation, RxJS observables\n- 1-high-priority/MOCK-INTERVIEW-QA.md: top 50 Q&As across JS, React, TS, system design,\n  Node, databases, and behavioural — formatted for spoken drill practice\n- 1-high-priority/NEGOTIATION-OFFER-DEEP.md: salary research, counter-offer scripts,\n  equity evaluation (RSUs vs options), competing offer leverage, what to read before signing\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e85864b9c0d4f4f585339099cdbcb7724d57b0ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/git/trees/e85864b9c0d4f4f585339099cdbcb7724d57b0ee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/git/commits/2507ab3744b17b1879ddfc9e1bdd71ad4a17d91b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commit/2507ab3744b17b1879ddfc9e1bdd71ad4a17d91b","node_id":"C_kwDOSbboJNoAKDI1MDdhYjM3NDRiMTdiMTg3OWRkZmM5ZTFiZGQ3MWFkNGExN2Q5MWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commit/7f0029defcb1d7ea1d76b1c057df1d57d32a1ae3","sha":"7f0029defcb1d7ea1d76b1c057df1d57d32a1ae3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commits/7f0029defcb1d7ea1d76b1c057df1d57d32a1ae3"}],"sha":"2507ab3744b17b1879ddfc9e1bdd71ad4a17d91b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commits/2507ab3744b17b1879ddfc9e1bdd71ad4a17d91b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commits/7f0029defcb1d7ea1d76b1c057df1d57d32a1ae3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T03:05:22Z","email":"hairui@gophr.app","name":"HairuiWang96"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T03:05:22Z","email":"hairui@gophr.app","name":"HairuiWang96"},"message":"Organise all reference files into priority folders\n\n3 folders for JS/fullstack interview prep:\n  1-high-priority/   (19 files) — core JS, React, TS, algorithms, system design\n  2-medium-priority/ (24 files) — auth, testing, Next.js, CSS, Docker, GraphQL\n  3-low-priority/    (36 files) — other languages, cloud, mobile, specialised topics\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"63862d8badb5e8e32bd426a18bf5bbf68be01f69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/git/trees/63862d8badb5e8e32bd426a18bf5bbf68be01f69"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/git/commits/7f0029defcb1d7ea1d76b1c057df1d57d32a1ae3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commit/7f0029defcb1d7ea1d76b1c057df1d57d32a1ae3","node_id":"C_kwDOSbboJNoAKDdmMDAyOWRlZmNiMWQ3ZWExZDc2YjFjMDU3ZGYxZDU3ZDMyYTFhZTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commit/a16ceecdd10cc36787d10523a6ab6c2bc7af677f","sha":"a16ceecdd10cc36787d10523a6ab6c2bc7af677f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commits/a16ceecdd10cc36787d10523a6ab6c2bc7af677f"}],"sha":"7f0029defcb1d7ea1d76b1c057df1d57d32a1ae3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commits/7f0029defcb1d7ea1d76b1c057df1d57d32a1ae3"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commits/a16ceecdd10cc36787d10523a6ab6c2bc7af677f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T03:02:00Z","email":"hairui@gophr.app","name":"HairuiWang96"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T03:02:00Z","email":"hairui@gophr.app","name":"HairuiWang96"},"message":"Add senior deep references for 9 remaining interview topics\n\nCovers: State Management (Redux/Zustand/Jotai/TanStack Query),\nData Structures (from scratch with complexity), Kafka & RabbitMQ,\nSystem Design (framework + 5 classic problems), TypeSc