api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commits/b75f20a6875feb4dc1690847e1910fff8d61fe39/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T01:08:41Z","email":"hairui@gophr.app","name":"HairuiWang96"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T01:08:41Z","email":"hairui@gophr.app","name":"HairuiWang96"},"message":"Add senior deep reference for web security (frontend/fullstack)\n\nCovers all 3 XSS types (stored/reflected/DOM-based) with attack flows and\nReact-specific pitfalls (dangerouslySetInnerHTML, SSR __INITIAL_STATE__), CSP\n(nonce/hash-based, Report-Only, common mistakes), CSRF (SameSite Strict/Lax/None,\nsynchronizer token, double-submit cookie, when CSRF doesn''t apply), CORS deep\ndive (simple vs preflighted, credentials constraint, 5 common misconfigurations),\nJWT security (localStorage vs httpOnly cookie vs in-memory, alg:none and RS256→\nHS256 confusion attacks, refresh token rotation), clickjacking, all 7 security\nheaders (HSTS, X-Content-Type-Options, Referrer-Policy, Permissions-Policy,\nCOOP, COEP), SRI, prototype pollution with 6 defenses, dependency supply chain\nsecurity, TLS/HTTPS, OAuth 2.0 + PKCE full React implementation (why Implicit\nis deprecated), and secure coding checklists for React and Node.js. Full\ninterview Q&A.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"41633cf801223ac0365bdf190a691d8adce95c13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/git/trees/41633cf801223ac0365bdf190a691d8adce95c13"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/git/commits/b75f20a6875feb4dc1690847e1910fff8d61fe39","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commit/b75f20a6875feb4dc1690847e1910fff8d61fe39","node_id":"C_kwDOSbboJNoAKGI3NWYyMGE2ODc1ZmViNGRjMTY5MDg0N2UxOTEwZmZmOGQ2MWZlMzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commit/b7bff00ea4242bc42242728293701d7b99b16551","sha":"b7bff00ea4242bc42242728293701d7b99b16551","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commits/b7bff00ea4242bc42242728293701d7b99b16551"}],"sha":"b75f20a6875feb4dc1690847e1910fff8d61fe39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commits/b75f20a6875feb4dc1690847e1910fff8d61fe39"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commits/b7bff00ea4242bc42242728293701d7b99b16551/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T01:08:28Z","email":"hairui@gophr.app","name":"HairuiWang96"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T01:08:28Z","email":"hairui@gophr.app","name":"HairuiWang96"},"message":"Add senior deep reference for Redis and caching strategies\n\nCovers all 8 Redis data structures (String, Hash, List, Set, Sorted Set,\nHyperLogLog, Streams, Bitmap) with ioredis examples, all 5 caching patterns\n(cache-aside, write-through, write-behind, read-through, refresh-ahead), cache\ninvalidation (TTL, event-driven, cache tags, version keys), all 8 eviction\npolicies, cache stampede solutions (mutex lock, probabilistic early expiry,\nstale-while-revalidate), session storage, rate limiting (fixed window, sliding\nwindow log/counter, Lua-scripted Sorted Set), pub/sub vs Streams, distributed\nlocking (correct SET NX EX + Redlock), Redis Cluster (hash slots), Sentinel,\nRDB vs AOF persistence, pipeline and MULTI/EXEC transactions, and Node.js\ncaching middleware and cache warming patterns. Full interview Q&A.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"51ff27cf6b8883e94f4d33560e18ab6d4b707ee5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/git/trees/51ff27cf6b8883e94f4d33560e18ab6d4b707ee5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/git/commits/b7bff00ea4242bc42242728293701d7b99b16551","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commit/b7bff00ea4242bc42242728293701d7b99b16551","node_id":"C_kwDOSbboJNoAKGI3YmZmMDBlYTQyNDJiYzQyMjQyNzI4MjkzNzAxZDdiOTliMTY1NTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commit/ab461b61ef1296997012621d847b5f6d4685fd92","sha":"ab461b61ef1296997012621d847b5f6d4685fd92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commits/ab461b61ef1296997012621d847b5f6d4685fd92"}],"sha":"b7bff00ea4242bc42242728293701d7b99b16551","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commits/b7bff00ea4242bc42242728293701d7b99b16551"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commits/ab461b61ef1296997012621d847b5f6d4685fd92/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T01:08:14Z","email":"hairui@gophr.app","name":"HairuiWang96"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T01:08:14Z","email":"hairui@gophr.app","name":"HairuiWang96"},"message":"Add senior deep reference for Microservices and Distributed Systems\n\nCovers monolith vs microservices tradeoffs, modular monolith, bounded contexts,\nREST vs gRPC (with Node.js examples), Kafka (topics/partitions/consumer groups/\nat-least-once delivery) and RabbitMQ (exchanges/DLQ/retry with amqplib),\nevent-driven architecture, CQRS, event sourcing, Saga pattern (choreography vs\norchestration with compensating transactions), Circuit Breaker (closed/open/\nhalf-open state machine with code), API Gateway and BFF pattern, service\ndiscovery, distributed tracing (OpenTelemetry/Jaeger), eventual consistency,\nCAP theorem, idempotency middleware, Strangler Fig migration, sidecar/ambassador\ndeployment patterns, and testing (unit, integration with Testcontainers, contract\ntesting with Pact). Full interview Q&A.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"92ee0fcdd0f93a8981b25948d071cf9892251d66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/git/trees/92ee0fcdd0f93a8981b25948d071cf9892251d66"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/git/commits/ab461b61ef1296997012621d847b5f6d4685fd92","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commit/ab461b61ef1296997012621d847b5f6d4685fd92","node_id":"C_kwDOSbboJNoAKGFiNDYxYjYxZWYxMjk2OTk3MDEyNjIxZDg0N2I1ZjZkNDY4NWZkOTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commit/2676d65886711e50d1ad137a14f97406d0c36a6e","sha":"2676d65886711e50d1ad137a14f97406d0c36a6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commits/2676d65886711e50d1ad137a14f97406d0c36a6e"}],"sha":"ab461b61ef1296997012621d847b5f6d4685fd92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commits/ab461b61ef1296997012621d847b5f6d4685fd92"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commits/2676d65886711e50d1ad137a14f97406d0c36a6e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T01:08:02Z","email":"hairui@gophr.app","name":"HairuiWang96"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T01:08:02Z","email":"hairui@gophr.app","name":"HairuiWang96"},"message":"Add senior deep reference for GraphQL\n\nCovers GraphQL vs REST, SDL (scalars, enums, interfaces, unions, input types),\nqueries/mutations/subscriptions, resolver chain and all 4 resolver args, context,\nN+1 problem with annotated bad example, DataLoader batching/caching fix, error\nhandling, cursor-based pagination (Relay spec), Apollo Server 4 + Apollo Client\n(useQuery/useMutation/optimistic UI), InMemoryCache normalization, code-first vs\nschema-first, Federation subgraphs, security (depth/complexity limiting,\nintrospection), APQ, and full interview Q&A.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"80a92821b2cffc92d94361aa3769ac795fa040a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/git/trees/80a92821b2cffc92d94361aa3769ac795fa040a5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/git/commits/2676d65886711e50d1ad137a14f97406d0c36a6e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commit/2676d65886711e50d1ad137a14f97406d0c36a6e","node_id":"C_kwDOSbboJNoAKDI2NzZkNjU4ODY3MTFlNTBkMWFkMTM3YTE0Zjk3NDA2ZDBjMzZhNmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commit/2fef68456a67ed170130cc8a26d5eca9c74ea8fd","sha":"2fef68456a67ed170130cc8a26d5eca9c74ea8fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commits/2fef68456a67ed170130cc8a26d5eca9c74ea8fd"}],"sha":"2676d65886711e50d1ad137a14f97406d0c36a6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commits/2676d65886711e50d1ad137a14f97406d0c36a6e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commits/2fef68456a67ed170130cc8a26d5eca9c74ea8fd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T01:07:47Z","email":"hairui@gophr.app","name":"HairuiWang96"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T01:07:47Z","email":"hairui@gophr.app","name":"HairuiWang96"},"message":"Add JS live coding interview cheatsheet with 25 implementations\n\ndebounce, throttle (leading/trailing), deepClone (circular ref safe), deepEqual,\nEventEmitter (on/off/emit/once), Promise.all/allSettled/race/any from scratch,\npromisify, flatten (recursive+iterative), curry, compose/pipe, memoize, LRU Cache,\ngroupBy, chunk, set operations, getNestedValue/setNestedValue, Observable,\nsleep/retry (with exponential backoff), parseQueryString, and Trie with autocomplete.\nIncludes quick reference on closures, this binding, prototype chain, event loop.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"943dadafab806eb7362af46782792b9efbec12bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/git/trees/943dadafab806eb7362af46782792b9efbec12bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/git/commits/2fef68456a67ed170130cc8a26d5eca9c74ea8fd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commit/2fef68456a67ed170130cc8a26d5eca9c74ea8fd","node_id":"C_kwDOSbboJNoAKDJmZWY2ODQ1NmE2N2VkMTcwMTMwY2M4YTI2ZDVlY2E5Yzc0ZWE4ZmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commit/186d63a9e7ccb24ffaab37e42f6f48a6c02f6a0e","sha":"186d63a9e7ccb24ffaab37e42f6f48a6c02f6a0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commits/186d63a9e7ccb24ffaab37e42f6f48a6c02f6a0e"}],"sha":"2fef68456a67ed170130cc8a26d5eca9c74ea8fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commits/2fef68456a67ed170130cc8a26d5eca9c74ea8fd"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commits/186d63a9e7ccb24ffaab37e42f6f48a6c02f6a0e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-16T17:32:15Z","email":"hairui@gophr.app","name":"HairuiWang96"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-16T17:32:15Z","email":"hairui@gophr.app","name":"HairuiWang96"},"message":"Add senior deep reference for Docker and Kubernetes\n\nDocker: container internals (namespaces, cgroups, OverlayFS), layer caching\noptimization, multi-stage builds, networking drivers, volumes, and security\n(non-root, distroless, build secrets, image scanning).\n\nKubernetes: full control plane architecture (apiserver, etcd, scheduler,\ncontroller-manager, kubelet, kube-proxy), reconciliation loop, Pods/\nDeployments/ReplicaSets, all Service types, Ingress and Ingress Controllers,\nConfigMaps vs Secrets (with External Secrets Operator pattern), PVCs and\nStatefulSets, resource requests/limits, HPA, RBAC and pod security contexts,\nrolling/blue-green/canary deployment strategies, liveness/readiness/startup\nprobes, namespaces, NetworkPolicy, Helm, kubectl cheatsheet, and full\ninterview Q&A.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6dbd044f92d9525771575a912c0cad84d777abe9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/git/trees/6dbd044f92d9525771575a912c0cad84d777abe9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/git/commits/186d63a9e7ccb24ffaab37e42f6f48a6c02f6a0e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commit/186d63a9e7ccb24ffaab37e42f6f48a6c02f6a0e","node_id":"C_kwDOSbboJNoAKDE4NmQ2M2E5ZTdjY2IyNGZmYWFiMzdlNDJmNmY0OGE2YzAyZjZhMGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commit/d7894ad17b61e048e877c35c4f14134552551b99","sha":"d7894ad17b61e048e877c35c4f14134552551b99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commits/d7894ad17b61e048e877c35c4f14134552551b99"}],"sha":"186d63a9e7ccb24ffaab37e42f6f48a6c02f6a0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commits/186d63a9e7ccb24ffaab37e42f6f48a6c02f6a0e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commits/d7894ad17b61e048e877c35c4f14134552551b99/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-16T17:23:25Z","email":"hairui@gophr.app","name":"HairuiWang96"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-16T17:23:25Z","email":"hairui@gophr.app","name":"HairuiWang96"},"message":"Add senior deep reference for UI/UX design principles and patterns\n\nCovers core UX laws (Fitts, Hick, Jakob, Nielsen''s 10 heuristics), design systems\nand Atomic Design, design tokens (2-tier primitive/semantic naming), typography\nscales and web font performance, color theory and WCAG contrast, 8pt spacing\nsystems, component design patterns (navigation, buttons, modals, tables), form\nUX best practices, loading/empty/error states, motion principles and easing,\nresponsive strategy with container queries, dark mode implementation, perceived\nperformance techniques (skeleton screens, optimistic UI, CLS), and full\ninterview Q&A.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ed5ecbf0112151a2f54a41f1ceffcd0527ea16b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/git/trees/ed5ecbf0112151a2f54a41f1ceffcd0527ea16b9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/git/commits/d7894ad17b61e048e877c35c4f14134552551b99","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commit/d7894ad17b61e048e877c35c4f14134552551b99","node_id":"C_kwDOSbboJNoAKGQ3ODk0YWQxN2I2MWUwNDhlODc3YzM1YzRmMTQxMzQ1NTI1NTFiOTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commit/a2b4bd5657e7f3decccf38f8209cafa796cf310b","sha":"a2b4bd5657e7f3decccf38f8209cafa796cf310b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commits/a2b4bd5657e7f3decccf38f8209cafa796cf310b"}],"sha":"d7894ad17b61e048e877c35c4f14134552551b99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commits/d7894ad17b61e048e877c35c4f14134552551b99"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HairuiWang96/taskboard/commits/a2b4bd5657e7f3decccf38f8209cafa796cf310b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-16T15:41:56Z","email":"hairui@gophr.app","name":"HairuiWang96"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-16T15:41:56Z","email":"hairui@gophr.app","name":"HairuiWang96"},"message":"Add senior deep reference for Express, Fastify, and NestJS\n\nCovers Express middleware pipeline, async error handling, router architecture,\nFastify plugin encapsulation, schema validation, serialization internals and\nfull hooks lifecycle, NestJS modules, dependency injection, request lifecycle,\nguards/interceptors/pipes/filters, and a full framework co