master/commit/270f7b78e8b693ef54cfa8c5dca97cabfe4f0254","sha":"270f7b78e8b693ef54cfa8c5dca97cabfe4f0254","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TheJan2020/pw-demo-master/commits/270f7b78e8b693ef54cfa8c5dca97cabfe4f0254"}],"sha":"6807ea24bee27afad084f5618f9b12e221585511","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TheJan2020/pw-demo-master/commits/6807ea24bee27afad084f5618f9b12e221585511"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64112255?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TheJan2020","id":64112255,"login":"TheJan2020","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MTEyMjU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TheJan2020/pw-demo-master/commits/270f7b78e8b693ef54cfa8c5dca97cabfe4f0254/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T09:34:53Z","email":"z_buh@hotmail.com","name":"ZeyadA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T09:34:53Z","email":"z_buh@hotmail.com","name":"ZeyadA"},"message":"Clinic Demo Live Agent — AudioSocket service on port 8092\n\nAdds a per-vertical SIP Live Agent isolated from the existing\nadmin-demo SLA (8090) and SLR (8091):\n\n- backend/app/demos/clinic/live_agent.py\n  - ClinicLiveAgentService — TCP AudioSocket listener + per-call\n    Gemini Live session + small pub/sub bus.\n  - CallSession — full audio plumbing cloned from sip_live_rep\n    (8 kHz↔16/24 kHz resample, half-duplex echo gate that respects\n    cda_interruption_enabled, deadline killer, transcript broadcast).\n  - load_persona() / load_kb() — on-disk overrides at\n    data/demos/clinic/{persona,kb}.txt; bundle ships with sensible\n    Arabic-first defaults (Layla persona + Riyadh clinic KB) so the\n    agent works the moment cda_enabled is set, even before the\n    Clinic SPA has pushed anything.\n\n- backend/app/demos/clinic/router.py extends with the agent control\n  plane:\n    GET/POST  /api/demo/clinic/agent/config\n    GET       /api/demo/clinic/agent/status\n    GET/POST  /api/demo/clinic/agent/prompt    (persona + kb publish)\n    WS        /api/demo/clinic/agent/ws        (call lifecycle + transcript)\n\n- backend/app/core/state.py — cda_* namespace:\n    cda_enabled / cda_bind_host / cda_bind_port (=8092) /\n    cda_voice (=Aoede) / cda_greeting (Arabic) / cda_max_call_s /\n    cda_interruption_enabled\n  Persisted to data/state.json on every change.\n\n- backend/app/main.py — clinic_live_agent_service.apply_config() at\n  startup, .stop() at shutdown, sandwiched between the existing\n  SLA / SLR service lifecycle.\n\n- frontend/demos/clinic — rebuild from prime-mate-clinic@HEAD: the\n  Knowledge Base + Persona pages now expose an \"Apply to Live Agent\"\n  button that publishes the saved body to the new endpoint.\n\n- DEMOSITEMAP.md §6b — fully documents the per-vertical-port\n  fallback model, the locked port allocation table, the FreePBX\n  dialplan + Custom Destination + feature code 9001, backend deploy\n  steps, and the function-call-tool follow-up scope that''s\n  deliberately out of this commit.\n\nTools (lookup_patient, list_free_slots, create_appointment, etc.)\nnot yet wired — the agent is knowledge-only for now. Once we move\nthe clinic data layer to the backend (see DEMOSITEMAP §6b open\nfollow-ups) the tools land in this same module.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"141c2021dbecaa41137aefa5cd117b8b3384eec5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TheJan2020/pw-demo-master/git/trees/141c2021dbecaa41137aefa5cd117b8b3384eec5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TheJan2020/pw-demo-master/git/commits/270f7b78e8b693ef54cfa8c5dca97cabfe4f0254","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64112255?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TheJan2020","id":64112255,"login":"TheJan2020","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MTEyMjU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/TheJan2020/pw-demo-master/commit/270f7b78e8b693ef54cfa8c5dca97cabfe4f0254","node_id":"C_kwDOSbdVDNoAKDI3MGY3Yjc4ZThiNjkzZWY1NGNmYThjNWRjYTk3Y2FiZmU0ZjAyNTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TheJan2020/pw-demo-master/commit/86930e39280b19a34e5b6e92d8a0d5b0d0d71970","sha":"86930e39280b19a34e5b6e92d8a0d5b0d0d71970","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TheJan2020/pw-demo-master/commits/86930e39280b19a34e5b6e92d8a0d5b0d0d71970"}],"sha":"270f7b78e8b693ef54cfa8c5dca97cabfe4f0254","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TheJan2020/pw-