/users/brendanhogan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brendanhogan/popcorn/commits/c28c55da9947cde5cc27992ce733811cb16a7a95/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-13T00:50:12Z","email":"brendan@bhogan.net","name":"Brendan Hogan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T00:50:12Z","email":"brendan@bhogan.net","name":"Brendan Hogan"},"message":"README: fix inaccuracies (Six→Seven pipelines, perplexity formula, etc)\n\nHonest audit caught a handful of small wrong statements and gaps:\n\n- \"Six pipelines\" → \"Seven pipelines\" (the How-it-works section has 7\n  numbered subsections).\n- The misleadingly-named \"Two-pass concept extraction\" callout now\n  accurately describes the numbered-reference trick (it''s one-pass).\n- The t-SNE perplexity formula now matches the code:\n  max(5, min(30, n//3)), with init=PCA and random_state=42.\n- Setup section now flags the one-time ~600MB Python-deps install and\n  the ~90MB HuggingFace embedding-model download on first build.\n- Setup links to console.anthropic.com for the API key.\n- New paragraph documents the Rebuild button''s async behavior\n  (background task + polling /api/wiki/build/status).\n- Documented the build_wiki skip flags (--no-llm, --no-meta, etc).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bac4e833889571547eb95ccd8c8b132be3cd7176","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brendanhogan/popcorn/git/trees/bac4e833889571547eb95ccd8c8b132be3cd7176"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brendanhogan/popcorn/git/commits/c28c55da9947cde5cc27992ce733811cb16a7a95","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{