ttps://github.com/brendanhogan","id":78052016,"login":"brendanhogan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MDUyMDE2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brendanhogan/popcorn/commits/c485e96af5562888ebdb6557eb92d57d990809fb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-13T00:40:24Z","email":"brendan@bhogan.net","name":"Brendan Hogan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T00:40:24Z","email":"brendan@bhogan.net","name":"Brendan Hogan"},"message":"Map: drop concept-label size to 1.5 user units, let zoom enlarge them\n\nPrevious approach kept labels at constant screen size, which meant\nzooming in did not help readability — labels just spread apart at the\nsame chunky size. Now:\n\n- Label font-size is set as an SVG attribute in user units (1.5),\n  so at default zoom (viewBox 220 wide rendered at ~600-1200 screen px)\n  labels render at roughly 4-8 screen pixels — small enough to feel like\n  annotation rather than chrome.\n- Labels scale naturally with zoom: zoom in to read.\n- Long titles truncated to 36 chars with an ellipsis.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"55b898a3751fb0967d2919a4af319c0b0ba19cd0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brendanhogan/popcorn/git/trees/55b898a3751fb0967d2919a4af319c0b0ba19cd0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brendanhogan/popcorn/git/commits/c485e96af5562888ebdb6557eb92d57d990809fb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78052016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brendanhogan","id":78052016,"login":"brendanhogan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MDUyMDE2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/brendanhogan/popcorn/commit/c485e96af5562888ebdb6557eb92d57d990809fb","node_id":"C_kwDOSbm-BNoAKGM0ODVlOTZhZjU1NjI4ODhlYmRiNjU1N2ViOTJkNTdkOTkwODA5ZmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/brendanhogan/popcorn/commit/672fcfa08f97ecc0d2e26d0644762f6e56462737","sha":"672fcfa08f97ecc0d2e26d0644762f6e56462737","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brendanhogan/popcorn/commits/672fcfa08f97ecc0d2e26d0644762f6e56462737"}],"sha":"c485e96af5562888ebdb6557eb92d57d990809fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brendanhogan/popcorn/commits/c485e96af5562888ebdb6557eb92d57d990809fb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78052016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brendanhogan","id":78052016,"login":"brendanhogan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MDUyMDE2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brendanhogan/popcorn/commits/672fcfa08f97ecc0d2e26d0644762f6e56462737/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-13T00:38:33Z","email":"brendan@bhogan.net","name":"Brendan Hogan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T00:38:33Z","email":"brendan@bhogan.net","name":"Brendan Hogan"},"message":"Map: shrink concept labels and keep them constant size across zoom\n\nConcept labels were 9px in viewBox units → ~32 screen pixels at default\nzoom (jumbled mess) and grew further when zooming in. Now:\n\n- Base size is 3px in viewBox units (≈11 screen px at default zoom)\n- A CSS variable --label-size is updated in updateViewBox() to\n  LABEL_BASE_VB / zoom, so labels stay at a constant screen size as you\n  zoom in/out. Zooming spreads labels apart instead of enlarging them.\n- Label vertical offset adjusted to track the new base size.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7c5bac74d0f467ae3192331487e1101e63056997","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brendanhogan/popcorn/git/trees/7c5bac74d0f467ae3192331487e1101e63056997"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brendanhogan/popcorn/git/commits/672fcfa08f97ecc0d2e26d0644762f6e56462737","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.