ogin":"brendanhogan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MDUyMDE2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brendanhogan/popcorn/commits/1d654bbbc11672c43cec39f5376c580b7da63760/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-13T00:36:34Z","email":"brendan@bhogan.net","name":"Brendan Hogan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T00:36:34Z","email":"brendan@bhogan.net","name":"Brendan Hogan"},"message":"Map: zoom/pan with wheel+drag + zoom controls; README: how-it-works section\n\nMap UX:\n- Scroll wheel zooms toward cursor (1.4× per notch, clamped 0.5–12×)\n- Drag empty space to pan; threshold-detected (won''t trigger idea\n  discovery if user moved more than 5px)\n- Explicit +/−/⌂ buttons in top-right of map for accessibility\n- Zoom level shown numerically\n- Click on points still navigates; click on empty space still triggers\n  idea discovery — mouseup-based dispatch distinguishes the two\n\nREADME:\n- New \"How it works\" section walks through all six pipelines step by\n  step with file pointers for each prompt: live ingest, screenshot\n  override, wiki build (11 steps), wiki viewer, map, idea discovery,\n  per-entry chat. Aimed at someone landing on the repo who wants to\n  understand the moving parts before reading code.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a5e559ed7b4eba67a83da3062b1f7d879165cae9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brendanhogan/popcorn/git/trees/a5e559ed7b4eba67a83da3062b1f7d879165cae9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brendanhogan/popcorn/git/commits/1d654bbbc11672c43cec39f5376c580b7da63760","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78052016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brendanhogan","id":78052016,"login":"brendanhogan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MDUyMDE2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/brendanhogan/popcorn/commit/1d654bbbc11672c43cec39f5376c580b7da63760","node_id":"C_kwDOSbm-BNoAKDFkNjU0YmJiYzExNjcyYzQzY2VjMzlmNTM3NmM1ODBiN2RhNjM3NjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/brendanhogan/popcorn/commit/caa3ae53249b5a46eaabb51cb60fa21fbee77e90","sha":"caa3ae53249b5a46eaabb51cb60fa21fbee77e90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brendanhogan/popcorn/commits/caa3ae53249b5a46eaabb51cb60fa21fbee77e90"}],"sha":"1d654bbbc11672c43cec39f5376c580b7da63760","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brendanhogan/popcorn/commits/1d654bbbc11672c43cec39f5376c580b7da63760"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78052016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brendanhogan","id":78052016,"login":"brendanhogan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MDUyMDE2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brendanhogan/popcorn/commits/caa3ae53249b5a46eaabb51cb60fa21fbee77e90/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T22:57:28Z","email":"brendan@bhogan.net","name":"Brendan Hogan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T22:57:28Z","email":"brendan@bhogan.net","name":"Brendan Hogan"},"message":"Wiki spirit: meta articles, entities, batch recaps, map, idea discovery\n\nFour new article kinds + a 2D map + a click-to-discover-ideas feature.\n\n- **Embeddings infrastructure** (app/embed.py): local sentence-transformers\n  (all-MiniLM-L6-v2, 384 dims, CPU). Embeds entries and concept pages,\n  stores as numpy npz. Zero API cost.\n\n- **Meta articles** (data/wiki/meta/*.md): cluster concept embeddings via\n  agglomerative clustering, then ask Sonnet to name and synthesize the\n  worldview tying each cluster together. Produces things like \"LLMs as\n  substrates for simulated minds and societies\" — one level of abstraction\n  above the individual concept pages.\n\n- **Entity articles** (data/wiki/entities/*.md): single Sonnet pass extracts\n  named entities (people, labs, companies, products, papers) appearing in\n  3+ entries. Each entity gets a page summarizing what the user has said\n  about it, with quotes from their notes.\n\n- **Batch recap articles** (data/wiki/batches/*.md): one journal-style\n  recap per past session. \"Persona simulation clicks; Claude Code life\n  deepens further.\" Reads ratings + notes as a retrospective.\n\n- **2D map view** (/wiki/map): sklearn t-SNE projection of all entry and\n  concept embeddings. SVG scatter; points sized by rating, colored by\n  date for time-drift. Hover for title, click to navigate. Concept\n  centroids overlaid as labeled markers.\n\n- **Idea discovery** (POST /api/wiki/ideas): click empty space on the map\n  → server finds K nearest entries → Sonnet proposes 2-3 specific\n  papers/posts/ideas that would naturally live in that empty patch of\n  idea-space, with a search query for each.\n\n- **Multi-kind wiki**: wiki.py extended to support arbitrary page kinds\n  (sources, concepts, meta, entities, batches). Sidebar surfaces all of\n  them with their counts.\n\nDeps added: sentence-transformers, scikit-learn, numpy. Local embeddings\nmean no embeddings-API key needed; everything runs on CPU in seconds.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"36649aebac0396cc1e260ed804999690247bdb56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brendanhogan/popcorn/git/trees/36649aebac0396cc1e260ed804999690247bdb56"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brendanhogan/popcorn/git/commits/caa3ae53249b5a46eaabb51cb60fa21fbee77e90","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78052016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brendanhogan","id":78052016,"login":"brendanhogan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MDUyMDE2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/brendanhogan/popcorn/commit/caa3ae53249b5a46eaabb51cb60fa21fbee77e90","node_id":"C_kwDOSbm-BNoAKGNhYTNhZTUzMjQ5YjVhNDZlYWFiYjUxY2I2MGZhMjFmYmVlNzdlOTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/brendanhogan/popcorn/commit/bca8bebce614c6dd5f7f518919184da99e759644","sha":"bca8bebce614c6dd5f7f518919184da99e759644","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brendanhogan/popcorn/commits/bca8bebce614c6dd5f7f518919184da99e759644"}],"sha":"caa3ae53249b5a46eaabb51cb60fa21fbee77e90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brendanhogan/popcorn/commits/caa3ae53249b5a46eaabb51cb60fa21fbee77e90"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78052016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brendanhogan","id":78052016,"login":"brendanhogan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MDUyMDE2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brendanhogan/popcorn/commits/bca8bebce614c6dd5f7f518919184da99e759644/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T21:48:52Z","email":"brendan@bhogan.net","name":"Brendan Hogan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T21:48:52Z","email":"brendan@bhogan.net","name":"Brendan Hogan"},"message":"Add wiki phase: backfill, concept synthesis, browseable viewer\n\n- app/import_history.py: bulk import past curated posts from a text file\n  in the user''s biweekly format. One session per date header; preserves\n  title/rating/notes verbatim; fetches summaries for non-Twitter URLs\n  (Haiku 4.5 for cost). Twitter entries store user notes as the content.\n\n- app/build_wiki.py: idempotent rebuild of data/wiki/. Writes one source\n  page per entry; sends all entries to Sonnet 4.6 to extract 15-25\n  recurring concepts; writes one concept page per theme with\n  Claude-synthesized prose that quotes the user''s notes. Two-pass\n  approach with numbered entry references for reliable concept→source\n  mapping.\n\n- app/wiki.py: storage + markdown rendering with [[wiki-link]] syntax.\n  Backlink discovery.\n\n- /wiki routes in FastAPI: SPA shell + JSON API for index, page content,\n  and rebuild trigger (background task).\n\n- static/wiki.{html,css,js}: viewer matching the existing aesthetic.\n  Sidebar with concept/source lists, click-to-navigate wiki links,\n  backlinks panel, filter box, async Rebuild button with status polling.\n\n- Entry model gains `backfilled: bool` and `source_post_date: str` so\n  the wiki phase can distinguish live-curated from bulk-imported entries.\n\n- README rewritten as a release-grade explainer covering both phases,\n  costs, limits, and customization points.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"91a8ddfafa7c004672ca1c53e54acb9ff1b4eb9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brendanhogan/popcorn/git/trees/91a8ddfafa7c004672ca1c53e54acb9ff1b4eb9b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brendanhogan/popcorn/git/commits/bca8bebce614c6dd5f7f518919184da99e759644","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78052016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brendanhogan","id":78052016,"login":"brendanhogan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MDUyMDE2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/brendanhogan/popcorn/commit/bca8bebce614c6dd5f7f518919184da99e759644","node_id":"C_kwDOSbm-BNoAKGJjYThiZWJjZTYxNGM2ZGQ1ZjdmNTE4OTE5MTg0ZGE5OWU3NTk2NDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/brendanhogan/popcorn/commit/1b4be23f2e7d2b724105c0cf1e4a9282578521b7","sha":"1b4be23f2e7d2b724105c0cf1e4a9282578521b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brendanhogan/popcorn/commits/1b4be23f2e7d2b724105c0cf1e4a9282578521b7"}],"sha":"bca8bebce614c6dd5f7f518919184da99e759644","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brendanhogan/popcorn/commits/bca8bebce614c6dd5f7f518919184da99e759644"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78052016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brendanhogan","id":78052016,"login":"brendanhogan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MDUyMDE2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendanhogan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brendanhogan/popcorn/commits/1b4be23f2e7d2b724105c0cf1e4a9282578521b7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T17:32:23Z","email":"brendan@bhogan.net","name":"Brendan Hogan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T17:32:23Z","email":"brendan@bhogan.net","name":"Brendan Hogan"},"message":"Initial commit: popcorn — reading-list ingestion tool\n\nLocal web app for processing a batch of links into structured entries\nready for a biweekly reading-list post. Inspired by Karpathy''s LLM Wiki\nidea, applied to the ingestion layer.\n\nFeatures:\n- Batch URL ingest with Claude-generated summaries and title suggestions\n- Screenshot OCR via Claude vision (works around Twitter/X scraping block)\n- Named sessions (auto-saved, switch between weekly batches)\n- Per-entry rating (🍿 1-4), notes, private flag\n- Multi-turn chat with each page''s content (prompt-cached for efficiency)\n- Plain text + JSON exports\n\nStack: FastAPI + Anth