e\n9.40.105+). With an optional per-camera password and an active interface,\nstream_url points straight at the camera (video only) and no cloud stream\nsession is used. Without a password or while inactive, behaviour is\nunchanged. Adds unit tests for the web-stream subscription handlers,\nfront-door idle timers and IPv6 address classification, and refreshes two\ntransitive lockfile entries (ip-address, moment) for current advisories.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019z5mQR1iygLnBX5BpZYzc4","tree":{"sha":"0cb1fd9d5885f2ad335b035d0f7172adc47f187a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/git/trees/0cb1fd9d5885f2ad335b035d0f7172adc47f187a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/git/commits/edb2fbc1c1abc18daa034dfe0fbfc181dd7b838b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10558666?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mosandlt","id":10558666,"login":"mosandlt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTU4NjY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosc