art-home-camera/git/commits/f8608ec6cf27e6bbe949ba2c6ae5f88b32f37260","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10558666?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mosandlt","id":10558666,"login":"mosandlt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTU4NjY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/commit/f8608ec6cf27e6bbe949ba2c6ae5f88b32f37260","node_id":"C_kwDOSbrR89oAKGY4NjA4ZWM2Y2YyN2U2YmJlOTQ5YmEyYzZhZTVmODhiMzJmMzcyNjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/commit/fcf0d683e1c7e13e1e92bb70eaf836e97ed720f1","sha":"fcf0d683e1c7e13e1e92bb70eaf836e97ed720f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/commits/fcf0d683e1c7e13e1e92bb70eaf836e97ed720f1"}],"sha":"f8608ec6cf27e6bbe949ba2c6ae5f88b32f37260","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/commits/f8608ec6cf27e6bbe949ba2c6ae5f88b32f37260"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10558666?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mosandlt","id":10558666,"login":"mosandlt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTU4NjY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/commits/fcf0d683e1c7e13e1e92bb70eaf836e97ed720f1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T17:12:57Z","email":"10558666+mosandlt@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mosandlt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T17:12:57Z","email":"10558666+mosandlt@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mosandlt"},"message":"perf/fix: pool keep-alive HTTPS agents for local digest + cloud API calls\n\nCross-Version-Fix (CROSS_VERSION_FIXES): the HA integration''s session-\npooling work today (fresh aiohttp.ClientSession per call -> pooled) has a\nreal Node.js analog here that a review confirmed and fixed:\n\n- digestRequest() (src/lib/digest.ts) -- the hot path for every LOCAL-LAN\n  digest call (RCP polling, heartbeats, light/privacy writes, every few\n  seconds per camera) -- built a fresh `new https.Agent(...)` on every\n  single call, forcing a TCP+TLS handshake each time. Now a shared,\n  keepAlive agent cached per rejectUnauthorized value\n  (getLocalDigestAgent()).\n- BoschCloudAgent (src/lib/auth.ts), used by the singleton _httpClient for\n  all cloud-API calls, had no explicit constructor -- Node''s https.Agent\n  default is keepAlive:false, so even though the client instance itself\n  was already a singleton, every call still paid a fresh handshake. Fixed\n  with an explicit keepAlive:true constructor.\n\nTwo other HA cross-version candidates were investigated and found to be\nnon-issues here, not force-fixed: the token-refresh timeout HA had to add\n(unbounded lock -> 15s) already exists in ioBroker''s cloud HTTP client\n(15s axios timeout was already set); and HA''s socket.setdefaulttimeout()\nprocess-global race has no Node.js analog (no axios.defaults.* set\nanywhere in src/, every call site configures its own timeout).\n\nBug-hunt (THREE_PER_ISSUE_PER_CHANGE, 3 independent sub-agents, all three\nfound the same real issue): the new keepAlive agents were never destroyed\nin onUnload(), so sockets that previously self-closed after each call\ncould now stay open up to keepAliveMsecs and delay adapter\nrestart/disable-cycle process exit. Fixed with a new\ndestroyLocalDigestAgents() export plus httpsAgent.destroy() on\n_httpClient in onUnload(), placed after the last closeLiveSession() call\nthat still needs _httpClient alive.\n\nPiP-survival (the HA v14.0.0 fix) was investigated and found NOT\napplicable here: HA''s bug came from HA-core''s own partial-panel-resolver\ntearing the whole Lovelace panel (incl. <video>) out of the DOM after 5\nminutes hidden. vis-2 has no equivalent automatic hidden-tab panel\nteardown, and BoschCamera.jsx''s existing _onVisibility() already avoids\ntearing down the live WebRTC video on a simple tab-hide (only a real\npagehide/unload does). No fix needed, documented rather than forced.\n\ntsc --noEmit clean, eslint clean, 1405 mocha passing (4 pending,\npre-existing) both before and after the onUnload fix.","tree":{"sha":"daf2222f13177c786ce418521bc15dc9676853d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/git/trees/daf2222f13177c786ce418521bc15dc9676853d3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/git/commits/fcf0d683e1c7e13e1e92bb70eaf836e97ed720f1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10558666?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mosandlt","id":10558666,"login":"mosandlt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTU4NjY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/commit/fcf0d683e1c7e13e1e92bb70eaf836e97ed720f1","node_id":"C_kwDOSbrR89oAKGZjZjBkNjgzZTFjN2UxM2UxZTkyYmI3MGVhZjgzNmU5N2VkNzIwZjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/commit/c1045fc677e22af2e64d2dfc302ca07519188dcc","sha":"c1045fc677e22af2e64d2dfc302ca07519188dcc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/commits/c1045fc677e22af2e64d2dfc302ca07519188dcc"}],"sha":"fcf0d683e1c7e13e1e92bb70eaf836e97ed720f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/commits/fcf0d683e1c7e13e1e92bb70eaf836e97ed720f1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10558666?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mosandlt","id":10558666,"login":"mosandlt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTU4NjY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/commits/c1045fc677e22af2e64d2dfc302ca07519188dcc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T11:13:14Z","email":"10558666+mosandlt@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mosandlt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T11:13:14Z","email":"10558666+mosandlt@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mosandlt"},"message":"docs: sync Integration Comparison table across all 6 repos\n\nRefreshes stale version numbers (HA v14.8.0, Python v10.11.0, ioBroker\nv1.8.0, MCP v1.7.0, Frontend v0.3.0a0, Node-RED v0.3.0-alpha) and\ncorrects feature-cell drift found since the last sync: Frontend''s\nlocally-diverged column (siren, rules CRUD, lighting read+write,\ncamera sharing, pan slider) verified true in code and merged back;\nioBroker v1.8.0 and MCP v1.7.0 write-capability additions (motion\nzones/masks, rules, sharing, lighting) reflected; Node-RED v0.3.0-alpha\nfront-spotlight/wallwasher node added. Table is now byte-identical\nacross all 6 READMEs per README_TABLES_SYNC.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Vjg2sNzobeTD3t2e7TsqZg","tree":{"sha":"ae7a32d47cd21834c447a0386b8193