57''s Checklist V2.1 review (landed 2026-07-02, commit 6a3b7a7/v1.7.6)\nflagged 6 issues; all fixed with regression tests:\n\n1. Hardcoded German-only notification/log text (maintenance banner,\n   camera-offline announce) leaked into this.log.info — now English-only.\n   New CI gate scripts/check-log-language.py scans src/**/*.ts for German\n   markers in this.log.* call sites.\n2. mqtt_password protectedNative/encryptedNative lived at the io-package.json\n   root instead of under common — ioBroker only reads those arrays from\n   common.*, so the password was neither masked nor encrypted. Moved under\n   common; pinned by test/unit/io_package_secrets.spec.ts.\n3. Externally-sourced camera IDs were used unsanitized to build ioBroker\n   object IDs — added sanitizeId() stripping adapter.FORBIDDEN_CHARS +\n   whitespace before any cameras.<id>.* object path is built.\n4. Dead `region` (EU/US) config option — CLOUD_API is, and always was,\n   hardcoded in auth.ts; the dropdown had no effect. Removed from\n   jsonConfig.json/io-package.json native/adapter-config.d.ts. Pinned by\n   test/unit/dead_region_config.spec.ts.\n5. README now credits/links Bosch Smart Home as manufacturer.\n6. Dead-code cleanup: _maskCreds, _featureFlagsCache, EVENT_POLL_INTERVAL_MS.\n\nAlso: createHttpClient() call sites switched to createCloudHttpClient()\ndirectly (deprecated shim kept for compat); maintenance-window timestamps\nnow formatted en-GB instead of de-DE (Europe/Berlin timezone retained).\n\n1347/1347 tests green, lint clean, log-language gate clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TMa5VT2gd56Sztg66vSmYn","tree":{"sha":"eb8ff8190319982790f92e13419812f573bfaeee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/git/trees/eb8ff8190319982790f92e13419812f573bfaeee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/git/commits/adeb16b8482d292570c27068efb