66?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mosandlt","id":10558666,"login":"mosandlt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTU4NjY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/commits/4099b4f52ea9831a28d093083336636201c008e9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T17:12:02Z","email":"10558666+mosandlt@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mosandlt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T17:12:02Z","email":"10558666+mosandlt@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mosandlt"},"message":"v1.7.6: CI quality gates — integration harness, build job, Node 20, coverage, i18n\n\nNew CI jobs and quality gates:\n- Integration test harness: test/integration.js using @iobroker/testing (clears repochecker E3053)\n- Build job: TypeScript compilation verified before adapter-tests\n- Node 20 added to test matrix (satisfies repochecker E3025 requirement)\n- Coverage gate: ≥80% lines/statements, ≥78% functions, ≥70% branches\n- i18n E5606 gate: flags strings identical to English (scripts/check-i18n.py)\nNo functional changes to adapter logic.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Ao5aQW4uRs9yHa5B1QY3Z8","tree":{"sha":"49d6daab02460fbc