.com>","tree":{"sha":"d6eab4f425134794a849cf9dc181134a61ee7a68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/git/trees/d6eab4f425134794a849cf9dc181134a61ee7a68"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/git/commits/e22082f0bc4b9f883af4a22f7e286f2ac2926c44","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10558666?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mosandlt","id":10558666,"login":"mosandlt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTU4NjY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/commit/e22082f0bc4b9f883af4a22f7e286f2ac2926c44","node_id":"C_kwDOSbrR89oAKGUyMjA4MmYwYmM0YjlmODgzYWY0YTIyZjdlMjg2ZjJhYzI5MjZjNDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/commit/4fe1889b1c0698caa3075d411e0cc2aab5c08341","sha":"4fe1889b1c0698caa3075d411e0cc2aab5c08341","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/commits/4fe1889b1c0698caa3075d411e0cc2aab5c08341"}],"sha":"e22082f0bc4b9f883af4a22f7e286f2ac2926c44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/commits/e22082f0bc4b9f883af4a22f7e286f2ac2926c44"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10558666?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mosandlt","id":10558666,"login":"mosandlt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTU4NjY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/commits/4fe1889b1c0698caa3075d411e0cc2aab5c08341/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T10:36:00Z","email":"10558666+mosandlt@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mosandlt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T10:36:00Z","email":"10558666+mosandlt@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mosandlt"},"message":"deps: bump @iobroker/adapter-core 3.4.1 + pin form-data/ws security floors\n\nClears two high-severity RUNTIME advisories flagged by the repochecker/\nnpm-audit gate (npm audit --omit=dev now reports 0):\n- form-data ^4.0.6 (override) — CRLF injection GHSA-hmw2-7cc7-3qxx (was 4.0.0-4.0.5)\n- ws ^8.21.0 (override) — memory-exhaustion DoS (was 8.0.0-8.20.1)\nAnd bumps @iobroker/adapter-core ^3.3.2 -> ^3.4.1 (repochecker W0083).\n\nFull suite 1323 passing / 0 failing on the new tree; build + eslint clean;\nruntime audit 0. adapter-core 3.4.1 is unit-verified (the sandbox keeps its\npinned 3.3.2 due to an override conflict; minor official-package bump).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"eb4c1e864fd2b57eefb61b44656e496c70218f44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/git/trees/eb4c1e864fd2b57eefb61b44656e496c70218f44"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/git/commits/4fe1889b1c0698caa3075d411e0cc2aab5c08341","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10558666?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mosandlt","id":10558666,"login":"mosandlt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTU4NjY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/commit/4fe1889b1c0698caa3075d411e0cc2aab5c08341","node_id":"C_kwDOSbrR89oAKDRmZTE4ODliMWMwNjk4Y2FhMzA3NWQ0MTFlMGNjMmFhYjVjMDgzNDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/commit/a90d91370746e973048f81125cfcb5de582150e9","sha":"a90d91370746e973048f81125cfcb5de582150e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/commits/a90d91370746e973048f81125cfcb5de582150e9"}],"sha":"4fe1889b1c0698caa3075d411e0cc2aab5c08341","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/commits/4fe1889b1c0698caa3075d411e0cc2aab5c08341"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10558666?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mosandlt","id":10558666,"login":"mosandlt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTU4NjY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/commits/a90d91370746e973048f81125cfcb5de582150e9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T10:20:01Z","email":"10558666+mosandlt@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mosandlt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T10:20:01Z","email":"10558666+mosandlt@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mosandlt"},"message":"v1.7.0 — daily event counters, BoschOverview live stream, widget reliability + backend fixes\n\nCross-version round porting the latest Home Assistant integration work.\n\nBackend:\n- iOB-S1: per-camera daily event counters events_today / movement_count /\n  audio_count, derived from /v11/events and bucketed by UTC day (mirrors HA\n  sensors; UTC avoids the local-midnight mis-count). Refreshed every poll so\n  they roll over at UTC midnight; events fetch limit raised 5->20.\n- iOB-B1: concurrent snapshot triggers for the same camera coalesce onto one\n  ensureLiveSession/fetch (mirrors HA _refresh_inflight).\n- iOB-B2: a camera stays online during an active cloud-maintenance window while\n  a local session is open, instead of being flipped offline by maintenance-\n  related snapshot failures (gated on _liveSessions, not user intent).\n\nWidget (BoschCamera + new BoschOverview features):\n- iOB-W1 offline/privacy last-frame backdrop (no black box).\n- iOB-W2 per-camera volume/mute localStorage keys.\n- iOB-W3 multi-instance audio registry keyed by camId (same-camera tiles mute\n  each other; different cameras independent).\n- iOB-W4 BoschOverview: live WebRTC/HLS in the expanded overlay (grid stays\n  snapshot), maintenance banner, last-event badge. Shared event-label helper.\n\nFound+fixed via adversarial verify-agents (per change). Full suite 1323 passing\n/ 0 failing, build + eslint clean. Live-verified on the dev sandbox (4 cameras,\nS1 counters populating, 0 errors). News 11 langs, README changelog updated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"608c9e5a94cc9d7229fe15f146c250e2e28abd81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/git/trees/608c9e5a94cc9d7229fe15f146c250e2e28abd81"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/git/commits/a90d91370746e973048f81125cfcb5de582150e9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10558666?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"",