ew\" VIS-2 widget: auto-discovering multi-camera grid,\n  online/privacy/offline tiers, per-tile controls, click-to-expand.\n- Single-camera card brought to Home Assistant parity: native <video> (go2rtc\n  RTCPeerConnection + HLS fallback) replaces the iframe → audio toggle, volume,\n  pause-guard, digital zoom; catalog-driven bottom-sheet controls; model-gated\n  pan; motion-zone/privacy-mask overlays; status badges.\n- Backend: privacy cameras report online correctly (cloud reconcile\n  LAN-TCP→ping→commissioned); new front_light_intensity datapoint.\n- Fix: no broken-image flash when leaving privacy mode (loading veil until the\n  first frame; immediate refetch on reveal).\n- Fix: indoor tiles auto-refresh their snapshot while visible (Gen1 360° 5s,\n  indoor model 10s); outdoor unchanged; gated by privacy/livestream/visibility\n  to spare the camera session budget.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a12dc99c2745477193173a2384d8fb877abdee2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/git/trees/a12dc99c2745477193173a2384d8fb877abdee2a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/git/commits/26985816ffd8385032944c36c9059f3c95585dcc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10558666?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mosandlt","id":10558666,"login":"mosandlt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTU4NjY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/recei