dlt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTU4NjY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/commits/99519fb64123ac16bccdd219ec76e546e8b5c123/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T13:06:35Z","email":"10558666+mosandlt@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mosandlt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T16:07:22Z","email":"10558666+mosandlt@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mosandlt"},"message":"v1.2.7: stream_host/stream_port/stream_path datapoints for ioBroker.cameras (forum #84538)\n\niobroker.cameras has no single full-URL field — its generic RTSP type composes the URL from separate Camera IP / Port / Path inputs, so users had to split stream_url by hand. Publish the three parts as read-only per-camera datapoints (stream_host: text, stream_port: value/number, stream_path: text) so each field can be pasted 1:1. Populated alongside stream_url on stream start, cleared on teardown and on privacy-driven credential rotation.\n\nREADME: External Recorders -> iobroker.cameras how-to with field-by-field mapping (Protocol = TCP, proxy is TCP-only). Object roles validated against the repochecker catalogue (0 E1008/E1009). Regression tests pin the host/port/path split and clear-on-off.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b64f6dd83825de813ff5fb0b169b06544b953758","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/git/trees/b64f6dd83825de813ff5fb0b169b06544b953758"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mosandlt/i