ttps://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mosandlt","id":10558666,"login":"mosandlt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTU4NjY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/commits/c9fce4a083433701d75ffef210b96857000ce608/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T04:20:11Z","email":"10558666+mosandlt@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mosandlt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T04:20:11Z","email":"10558666+mosandlt@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mosandlt"},"message":"README: unify badges to flat style, reliable npm/l license badge, English cleanup, remove Roadmap\n\n- All badges now one consistent flat shields style (was mixed flat + style=for-the-badge).\n- License badge switched from github/license (depends on GitHub auto-detection, can render ''not identifiable'') to npm/l (reads manifest -> always MIT).\n- English-only: model names (Aussenkamera/Innenkamera -> Outdoor/Indoor), MQTT example cam_name, two changelog strings, legal citation.\n- Removed broken Bosch store hyperlinks (all 404 after a site restructure); kept plain English names.\n- Removed Roadmap section + its ToC entry. ToC anchors verified intact.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c6e5d3fed1838963759106b7d7a10c41615d8111","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/git/trees/c6e5d3fed1838963759106b7d7a10c41615d8111"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/git/commits/c9fce4a083433701d75ffef210b96857000ce608","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10558666?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mosandlt","id":10558666,"login":"mosandlt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTU4NjY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/commit/c9fce4a083433701d75ffef210b96857000ce608","node_id":"C_kwDOSbrR89oAKGM5ZmNlNGEwODM0MzM3MDFkNzVmZmVmMjEwYjk2ODU3MDAwY2U2MDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/commit/2599a45dc1da69e289c55561b2c79a9c5a2834db","sha":"2599a45dc1da69e289c55561b2c79a9c5a2834db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/commits/2599a45dc1da69e289c55561b2c79a9c5a2834db"}],"sha":"c9fce4a083433701d75ffef210b96857000ce608","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/commits/c9fce4a083433701d75ffef210b96857000ce608"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10558666?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mosandlt","id":10558666,"login":"mosandlt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTU4NjY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/commits/2599a45dc1da69e289c55561b2c79a9c5a2834db/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T03:59:30Z","email":"10558666+mosandlt@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mosandlt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T03:59:30Z","email":"10558666+mosandlt@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mosandlt"},"message":"v1.2.6: fix invalid object roles (repochecker E1008/E1009) + auto-migration\n\nThe repository object-structure check rejected 14+ states whose common.role\nwas not in the ioBroker role catalogue (E1008) or used a type the role\nforbids (E1009). Corrected to catalogue-valid roles:\n\n- info.fcm_active / info.connection_status / info.maintenance.state:\n  indicator.status|indicator.state -> info.status\n- last_motion_at / last_event_image_at: value.time -> date\n  (value.time only supports type number; these store ISO-8601 strings)\n- stream_quality / motion_sensitivity / detection_mode: level.mode -> text\n- onvif_scopes / cloud.feature_flags: info -> json\n- wifi_signal_pct: value.signal -> value\n- pan_position: value.angle -> level\n- last_seen_event_id: value -> text (value needs number)\n\nAdded _migrateStateRoles(): a one-time idempotent migration in onReady\n(runs before the login flow) that rewrites these roles on existing\ninstalls via extendObject. Verified live on the dev sandbox (37+5 objects\ncorrected, idempotent on second start, 0 errors).\n\nRegression tests boot a full instance and pin every corrected role +\nassert no state uses an out-of-catalogue role or value/value.time+string.\n\nREADME: added nodei.co npm badge to the header.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ec78e8c75117d52b1772227943ed75f7d3ea08cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/git/trees/ec78e8c75117d52b1772227943ed75f7d3ea08cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/git/commits/2599a45dc1da69e289c55561b2c79a9c5a2834db","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10558666?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mosandlt","id":10558666,"login":"mosandlt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTU4NjY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosandlt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/commit/2599a45dc1da69e289c55561b2c79a9c5a2834db","node_id":"C_kwDOSbrR89oAKDI1OTlhNDVkYzFkYTY5ZTI4OWM1NTU2MWIyYzc5YTljNWEyODM0ZGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/commit/11fe0dce84bb50ef168035d04dfdd8cf37a75765","sha":"11fe0dce84bb50ef168035d04dfdd8cf37a75765","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/commits/11fe0dce84bb50ef168035d04dfdd8cf37a75765"}],"sha":"2599a45dc1da69e289c55561b2c79a9c5a2834db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/commits/2599a45dc1da69e289c55561b2c79a9c5a2834db"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/mosandlt/ioBroker.bosch-smart-home-camera/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=63eb75510deb69532f836c2a22a10faa782230cf&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A18%3A23.734Z"}');
